<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Eksodas</book>
  <para style="h">Eksodas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eksodas</para>
  <para style="toc2">Eksodas</para>
  <para style="mt">Eksodas</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hiaite Aigupta gam a honglut, Israel suante min ahi: Michih leh a inkawte Jakob toh hongtonte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Reuben, Simeon, Levi leh Judah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Issakar, Zebulun leh Benjamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dan leh Naphtali, Gad leh Asher.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob tai apan hong pawtkhia mi tengteng sawmsagih ahi uhi Joseph bel Aigupta gam ah a na om khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joseph leh a unau tengteng leh a suan tengteng leng a sita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel suante’n gah a suang ua, tampi in a khang ua, a kibehlap ua, hat petmah in a hong hatkhia ua; a gam a hong dimta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joseph theilou, Aigupta gam ah kumpipa thak a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a mite kiang ah, “En un, Israel suan mipite ei sang in a tam zaw ua, a hatzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kisa un, piltak in amau i bawl ding uhi. Huchilou in zaw a hong kibehlap lap ding ua, hichi a honghi dia, kidouna a hongom chiang in, i melmate lam ah a pang ding ua, ei a hondou kha ding uhi, huchi in gam apan a pawtsan kha ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in puakgikte a amau hihgim ding in a tung uah nasem heutu a koihta uhi. Huchi in, Pharo ading in khopite, Pithom leh Rameses a lamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh amau a hihgim semsem uleh, a kibehlap semsem ua, a khang semsem uhi. Huchi in Aiguptate’n Israel suante a lau mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in Aiguptate’n Israel suante gimtakin nna a semsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nasep haksa in a hinna uh nuamloutakin a bawlsak ua, buan mante leh teklei bawl in gamlak a nna chiteng sem in, nakpitak in nna a semsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa’n Hebru naudommite kiang ah thu a gen a, huaite lak a khat min Siprah ahi a, a dang khat min Puah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hebru numeite lak a nau na dom chiang un, tutphah tung ah en unla, tapa ahihleh na that ding ua, tanu ahihleh na hawi ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh naudommite’n Pathian a lau ua, Aigupta kumpipa’n thu a piak bang a hihlou in, pasal naupangte a hinghawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa’n naudommite a samsaka, a kiang uah, “Bangdia hiai thilhih a pasal naupangte hinghawi na hi ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naudommite’n Pharo kiang ah, “Hebru numeite Aigupta numeite bang ahihlouh ziak un, a tei ngal ua, naudommite a kiang uh a tun ma un a neikhin zel uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian in naudommite a kem hoih a, huchi in mite a hong kibehlap ua, a hat mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in naudommite’n Pathian a lauh ziak un inkuante a bawlsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pharo in a sikha tengteng thupia in, “Tapa hongpiang peuhmah lui ah na pai ding ua, tanu hong piang peuhmah na hinghawi ding uh,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Levi inn apan pasal khat a paikhia a, Levi tanu zi in a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai numei in nau a pai a, tapa a nei a, naupang melhoih ahi chih a theih in kha thum a selta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sel zoh nawnlouh tak in, phaiphek bawm a bawlsak a, vahaibuan leh chim in a zutbit a, asung ah nau a koih a; luipang ah loupa kawm ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sanggamnu, bang hongsuak hiam chih thei ding in gamla kuam ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pharo tanu lui ah kisil ding in a hong paisuk a; a nungzui numeite toh luigei ah a vak uhi. Loupa lak a bawm a mu a, a sikha numei khat va la ding in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hon leh, naupang a muta a, ngai in, naungek a kapta hi. A hehpihta a, “Hiai Hebru tate lak a khat ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sanggamnu’n Pharo tanu kiang ah, “Nau hon donsak ding, Hebru numeite lak a naudonmi khat k’on va sapsak na ut hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pharo tanu in a kiang ah, “Kuan in,” a chi hi. Nungak a kuanta a, naungek nu a vasamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pharo tanu in a kiang ah, “Hiai nau la inla, hon donsak in. Na loh k’on pe ding” a chi hi. Huchi in huai numei in nau a lata a, a donta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nau a khang a, Pharo tanu kiang ah a honpi a, huchi in a tapa a hong hita hi. “A min Mosi a sa a, tui apan ka kaihkhiak a hih ziak in,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huailai in hichi ahi a, Mosi a honglet in a unaute kiang ah a va hoh a, a puakgikte uh a va mu hi. A unaute lak a khat, Hebru mi khat Aigupta mi in a vuaklai a va muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A dak loplop a, kuamah a omkei, chih a theihtakin, Aigupta mi a thatta a, piaunel ah a sel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ni nih ni a, a va hohnawn leh, ngai in, Hebru mite lak a mi nih a na kisual ua; gilou hihpa kiang ah, “Bangdia na lawm vua na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “Ka tung ua lal leh vaihawm dia nang kua’n honbawl ahia? Aigupta mi na thah bang a, hon thah tum na hi maw?” a chi hi. Huchi in, Mosi a lau a, “Hiai thil kithei khe petmah eive,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharo in hiai a zak in, Mosi thah ding in a zongta hi. Himahleh Pharo mai apan Mosi a taimangta a, Midian gam ah a tengta a; tuileh kiang ah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midian siampu in tanu sagih a nei a, amau a hongpai ua, tui a hontawi ua, a pa uh ganhon buahna ding in a tuitheite a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Belamchingte a hong ua, a hawlmang uhi. Himahleh, Mosi ading a, amau a panpiha, a ganhon uh tui a buak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa uh Reuel kiang a a hongpai tak un, “Bang a chia, tuni’n hong paibaih ve uchia?” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau, “Belamchingte khut apan Aigupta mi khat in a hon hunkhia a, tui leng a hontawi chingsak a, ganhon a buak hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman a tanute kiang ah, “Ahihleh amah kaw om ahia? Bangdia huai mi hon nusia? An ne ding in sam un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosi huai mi kiang a ten a lungkima, aman a tanu Zipporah Mosi a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tapa a neihsaka, melmak gam ah mikhual ka hita, a chih ziak in a min Gershom a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hun hongpai zel ah hichi ahi a, Aigupta kumpipa a sita a, huchi in a koltan ziak un Israel suante a thumthum ua, a kap ua, a kahna uh a koltan ziak un Pathian kiang ah a tungtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A mauna uh Pathian in a za a, huchi in Pathian in Abraham toh, Isak toh leh Jakob toh a thukhun a theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian in Israel suante a en a, Pathian in amau a zahtak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosi in a sungpa, Midian siampu, Jethro ganhon a ching hi. Ganhon gamdai nunglam a pi in, Pathian tang, Horeb pha in, a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawn lak apan meikuang in a kiang ah Toupa Angel a hong kilak hi. A en a, ngai in, mei in pawn a kuang a, himahleh pawn a kangkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi in, “Ka kihei dia, hiai thilmuh thupi, bangdia pawn kanglou ahia, ka en ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi a en dia a kihei Toupa’n a muh in pawn apan amah a sam a, “Mosi, Mosi” a chi hi. Aman, “Hiai ah ka om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman, “Hiai mun hon naihken. Na khepek apan na khedapte suah in. Na dinna mun lei siangthou ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai a chilai a, “Na Pa Pathian ka hi, Abraham Pathian, Isak Pathian leh Jakob Pathian.” Mosi in Pathian a et ngamlouh ziak in a mai a sel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n “Aigupta gam a ka mite thuakgimna ka mu a, a tung ua nasem heutute ziak a a kah uh ka zata a, a dahnate uh ka thei hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aiguptate khut apan amau pikhe ding leh huai gam apan gam hoih, za, bawngnawi leh khuaizu a luanggam tundia hong paisuk ka hi; Kanante, Hitte, Amorte, Perizte, Hivte leh Jebuste gam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin, ngai in, Israel suante kah thawm ka kiang a hongtungta. Aiguptate’n amau a nuaisiah uh leng ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin kisa in, Pharo kiang ah k’on sawl ding, Aigupta gam apan Israel suante, ka mite n’on pikhiak theihna ding in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosi in Pathian kiang ah, “Pharo kiang a hoh a, Aigupta gam apan Israel suante pikhe ding, kei kua ka hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman, “Na kiang ah ka om ngeingei ding, k’on sawl chih, hiai nang ading in a kitheina ahi ding. Aigupta gam apan mite n’on pikhiak khit chiang in, hiai tangtung ah Pathian nna nasem ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi in Pathian kiang ah, “Ngai in, Israel suante kiang a ka hong a, a kiang ua, hichia ka chih chiang in, na pipute uh Pathian in na kiang uah a honsawl, amau huchi in ka kiang ah a chi ding uh, A min bang ahia? A kiang uah bang ka chi dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in Mosi kiang ah, “KA HIH KA HI” a chi hi. Huchibang in Israel suante kiang ah na vagen ding, “KA HIH in na kiang uah a honsawl hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian in Mosi kiang ah huchi in a chih behlap lai hi. “Israel suante Pathian, Abraham Pathian, Isak Pathian leh Jakob Pathian in na kiang uah a honsawl. Hiai ka min ahi gige a, suan tengteng tan a kei theihgigena ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuan inla, Israel upate kaikhawm inla, a kiang uah hichi’n chi in. ‘Na pipute uh Toupa Pathian, Abraham Pathian, Isak Pathian leh Jakob Pathian ka kiang ah a hong kilak a, hichi’n a chi, Ka hongveh petmah a, Aigupta gam a na tung ua hih a omte ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichi in ka chita, Aigupta gimna apan Kanante, Hitte, Amorte, Perizte, Hivte leh Jebuste gam, bawngnawi leh khuaizu luanna ah k’on pilut ding’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na aw a ngaikhe ding uhi. Huchi in na kuan dia, nang leh Israel upate, Aigupta kumpipa kiang ah na hoh ding ua, a kiang ah hichibang in na chi ding uhi. ‘Hebrute Toupa Pathian in hon kimuhpih a, tuin, ka hon ngen uhi, hon paisak in, gamdai a ni thum lam a Toupa ka Pathian uh kiang a ka kithoih theihna ding un.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi a, Aigupta kumpipa’n a hon paisak kei ding, ban thahatna toh lou in chih ka theitel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ban ka zak dia, a lak ua ka hih ding ka thillamdang tengteng in Aigupta gam ka gawt ding. Huai nung in a hon paisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aiguptate mitmuh in hiai mite deihsakna ka pe ding. Huchi in hichi ahi dia, na pai chiang un a khutvuak in na pai kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Numei teng in invengte leh a inn a khualtamte apan dangka suangmantamte, dangkaeng suangmantamte leh puansilhte a leitawi ding. Huchi in huaite na tapate uh na silhsak ding ua, na tanute uh na silhsak ding uhi. Huchi in Aiguptate na lok ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Mosi in a dawng a, “A hina a, ngai in, a hon umkei ding ua, ka aw leng a ngaikhe sam kei ding uhi. Toupa na kiang ah a kilakkei, a chih ding ziak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Na khut a bang ahia?” a chi a; aman, “Chiang” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman, “Lei ah khia in” a chi a; lei ah a khia a, gul a hongsuak a; Mosi huai apan a taikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Na khutzan inla, gul a mei in la in” a chi hi. A khut a zan a, gul a mei in a manta a, a khut ah chiang a hongsuak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pipute uh Toupa Pathian, Abraham Pathian, Isak Pathian leh Jakob Pathian, na kiang ah a kilak chih a gintakna ding un“ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Tuin na khut na ang ah koih in” a chi nawn hi. A khut a ang ah a koih a, a zankhiak tak in, ngai in, a khut vuk bang in a phakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aman na khut na ang ah koihnawn in” a chi hi. A khut a ang ah a koihnawn a, a ang apan a lakhia a, ngai in, a khut khatlam bang a hongsuak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hichi ahi dia, a hon gintak kei ua, chiamtehna khatna aw leng a ngaihkhiak sam kei uleh, chiamtehna nanung aw a gintak ding uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi a honghi dia, hiai chiamtehna nihte a gintak kei lai ua, na aw leng a ngaihkhiak sam kei uleh, lui apan tui na la dia, gamkeu ah na sung ding. Lui apan na tui lakkhiak gamkeu ah sisan a honghi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosi in Toupa kiang ah, “Aw Toupa , mi dangnal ka hi kei, chiklai mah in, na sikha kiang a thu na gen nungsang in leng mi dangawk leh pau zekai ka hizaw hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Mihing kam bawl kua ahia? Ahihkeileh pautheiloute, bengngongte, muhnate leh mittawte kua bawl ahia? Kei Toupa’n ka bawl ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin kuan inla, na kam ka ompih dia, na gen ding k’on hilh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman, “Aw Toupa , hehpih in midang sawl in, na sawl dingpa khut in, k’on ngen hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mosi tung ah Toupa hehna a souta a, “Aron, na unaupa a omkei maw? Hoihtak in thu a genthei, chih ka thei. Huan, ngai in, nang kimuhpih ding in a hongpaikhia a, a honmuh chiang in a lungtang a kipak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kiang ah thu na gen dia, a kam ah thute na guang ding. Na kam ka ompih dia, na hih ding k’on hilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah mite kiang ah na thugenpa ahi dia; amah nang adia kam tang ahi ding. Nang amah ading in Pathian tang na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chiamtehnate na hihna ding in, na khut in hiai chiang na tawi ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosi a kisa a, a sungpa Jethro kiang ah a kik a, a kiang ah, “K’on ngen hi. Hon paisak inla, Aigupta gam a om ka unaute kiang ah ka kik ding, a damlai u hiam ka va thei ding” a chi hi. Jethro in Mosi kiang ah, “Damtak in va hoh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n Midian gam a Mosi kiang ah, “Pai inla, Aigupta gam ah kiknawn in. Thah hon tum mi teng lah a sita ngal ua” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosi in a zi leh a tate a pi a, sabiltung tung ah a tuangsak a, Aigupta gam ah a kiknawnta hi. Mosi in a khut in Pathian chiang a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aigupta gam a kiknawn dia na kuan chiang in, na khut a ka koih huai thillamdangte tengteng Pharo ma ah hih ngeingei in. Himahleh a lungtang ka khauhsak dia, huchi in mite a paisak kei ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pharo kiang ah,“ Toupa’n Israel ka tapa ahi, ka ta masapen pen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />k’on chi ahi, na a hon sepsak theihna ding in, ka tapa paisak in. Paisak na nial leh ngai in, na tapa ka that ding, na ta masapen mahmah, na chi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lampi a khualbuk ah hichi a hong hita, Toupa’n amah a na tuak a, thah ding in a zongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchihlai in Zipporah in suang hiam a la a, a tapa zekmuk vun a atkhia a, a khebul ah a khia a, “Kei ading in sikai pasal na hi mahmah hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in amah a paisak hi. Zekvun ziak in “Sisan kai pasal na hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n Aron kiang ah, “Mosi tuak ding in gamdai ah hoh in” a chi hi. A hohta a, Pathian tang ah amah a tuak a, a tawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosi in amah sawl Toupa thu tengteng leh amah a piak chiamtehna tengteng toh Aron a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron a paita ua; Israel suan upate tengteng a kaikhawm vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosi kiang a Toupa’n thu a gen tengteng leh mite mitmuh a chiamtehna a hih tengteng Aron in a genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in mite’n a gingta ua; Toupa’n Israel suante a hongveh a, a gimna uh a muta, chih a zaktak un, a lu uh kunsak in a beta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, huai nung in Mosi leh Aron a lut ua, “Hichibang in Israelte Toupa Pathian in a chi. Gamdai a kei adia Ankuangluina a bawl theihna ding un, ka mite paisak in” chi’n, Pharo a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharo in, “Israelte paisak dia a aw ka man ding, Toupa kua ahia? Hiai Toupa ka theikei, Israelte leng ka paisak kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in amau, “Hebrute Pathian in a hon kimuhpih a; gamdai ah ni thum lam ah, hon paisak in, k’on ngen uhi. Toupa ka Pathian kiang ah hon kithoihsak in. Hi hiam, namsau hiam in a hon gawt kha ding hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa’n a kiang uah, “Bangdia Mosi leh Aron, noute’n nna nasep ua mite khawl sak na hi ua? Na puakgikte uh pua un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pharo in, “Ngai un, gam a mite tuin a tam ua, a puakgik ua pan na khawlsak uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pharo in huai ni mah in mite nasem heutute leh upate thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuma siah a bang in teklei bawlna ding in mite pawl na pe nawn kei ding uhi. Kuan uhenla, pawl va kilak uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuma siah a teklei bawlsa tengteng uh, a tung uah na koih ding a; huai apan in bangmah na kiamsak kei ding uhi. A tha uh a dah kha dia; huchi in kap in, ka Pathian kiang uah hon paisak inla, hon va kithoihsakin, a chi kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nna tamsem a tung uah guan unla, a sepgim theihna ding un; thu ginalou limsak kei uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mite nasem heutute a paikhia ua, a upate u toh, mite kiang ah thu a gen ua, “Pharo in pawl a honpe kei ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Nou kuan unla, na muhtheih theihna uah pawl kilak un.’ Himahleh nna nasep uah bangmah kiamsak ahi kei ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite pawl hilou in buhbul lakhawm ding in Aigupta gam teng ah a vak zakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nasem heutute’n amau a nawh ua, nna nasep uh zou un, na niteng sep dingte uh, pawl a omlai in, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel suan upate, Pharo nasem heutute a tung ua a koihte un, a vua ua, bangdia tuma siah a bang a zan leh tuni a na teklei bawl uh zoulou na hi ua? chi’n, a phutluih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaitak in Israel suan upate a hong ua, Pharo kiang ah a kap ua, “Bangdia na sikhate hichi bawl tel na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sikhate pawl piak ka hi kei ua, amau lah ka kiang uah, teklei bawl un, a chi uhi. Ngai in, na sikhate vuak in ka om ua, a mawh na mite ahi uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh aman, “Thadah na hi uh, thadah na hi uh. Huaiziak in, hon paisak inla, Toupa kiang ah hon va kithoih sak un, na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in kuan unla; nna vasem un. Pawl a hon kipe kei dia, himahleh teklei bikhiah zah na piakkhiak ding uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na niteng nasep ua na tekleite ua pan bangmah na kiam sak ding uh ahi kei, a kichih nung Israel suan upate’n thusia om a hih dan a theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pharo apan a hong paikhiak un lampi ading Mosi leh Aron a kituahpih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kiang uah, “ Toupa’n nou hon en in vaihawm hen. Pharo mit leh a sikhate mit in ka gimnam uh kihhuai in na bawl ua, kou honthat dia a khut ua namsau na koih tak ziak in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah Mosi a kiknawn a, “ Toupa , bangdia hiai mite hichibang a gilou suaksak na hia? Bangdia kei honsawl na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na min a thu gen dia Pharo kiang a ka va hoh nungsiah lah, aman hiai mite tung ah gilou a bawl ngal a. Na mite lah na pikhe hetkei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Tuin Pharo kiang a bang ahia ka hih ding na mu ding. Khut thahat in amau a paisak dia, khut thahat in amau a gam apan a hawlkhe ding ahi ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thilbangkim hihthei Pathian min in Abraham kiang ah, Isak kiang ah leh Jakob kiang ah ka kilakta. Himahleh ka min JEHOVAH in a lak ua theih ka hi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau Kanan gam, mikhual a a omna gam uh, a khualzinna gam uh, pe ding in amau toh ka thukhun leng ka hihkipta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aiguptate’n koltanna a, a tansak un, Israel suante maunate leng ka zata a, ka thukhun ka theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Israel suante kiang ah, Toupa ka hi, chih gen inla, Aiguptate puakgik nuai apan k’on pikhe dia, na koltanna ua pan k’on suaktasak ding, banzak in leh vaihawmna thupite toh ka hontan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipite ading in ka hong kilak dia, nou ading in Pathian ka hi ding. Huchi in Aiguptate puakgikte nuai apan hon lakhepa Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, chih na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam tungtang thu Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a pedia ka chiam, gamsung ah k’on tun ding. Huchi in, gouluah ding in k’on pe ding, Kei Toupa ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in Israel suante kiang ah huchibang in thu a genta. Himahleh lungsim dahna ziak leh koltanna haksatna ziak in Mosi a ngaikheta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Lut in, a gam apan Israel suante a paikhiak sakna ding in Pharo kiang ah thu gen in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosi in Toupa ma ah thu a genta a, “Ngai in, Israel suante’n hon ngaihkhiak kei ua leh kei muk sumlouh, bangchi’n Pharo in hon ngaikhe dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Mosi kiang leh Aron kiang ah thu a gen a, Aigupta gam apan Israel suante pikhe ding in Israel suante lam leh Aigupta kumpipa lam ah amau thu a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiaite a suangtute inn a kipan a lupente ahi uhi: Reuben Israel tapa masa pen; Hanok leh Pallu, Hezron leh Karmi. Hiaite Reuben inkawte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simeon tapate: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakin, Zohar leh Kanan numei tapa Shaul. Hiaite Simeon inkawte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A khang uh dungzui in hiaite Levi tapate min ahi: Gershon, Kohath leh Merari. Levi damsung kumte kum za leh sawmthum leh sagih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gershon tapate, a inkaw dungzui un, Libni leh Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath tapate: Amram, Izhar, Hebron leh Uzziel. Kohath damsung kumte kum za leh sawmthum leh thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari tapate: Mahali leh Musi. A khang uh dungzui in hiaite Levi inkawte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amram in a pa sanggamnu Jokebed zi in a nei hi. Aman Aron leh Mosi a neihsak hi. Amram damsung kumte kum za leh sawmthum leh sagih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izhar tapate: Korah, Nepheg leh Zikri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzziel tapate: Misael, Elzaphan leh Zithri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aron in Amminadab tanu, Nahson sanggamnu, Eliseba zi in a nei a, Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, leh Ithamar a neihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Korah tapate: Assir, Elkanah leh Abiasaph. Hiaite Korah inkawte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aron tapa Eleazar in Putiel tanute lak a khat zi in a nei a, Phinehas a neihsak hi. Hiaite Levi inkuan suangtute inn a kipan a lupente ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hiaite Toupa’n Aron leh Mosi kiang a a nam uh dungzui a Aigupta gam apan Israel suante hon pikhia un, a chihte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiaite Aigupta kumpipa Pharo kiang a Aigupta apan Israel suante pikhe dia thugentute ahi uhi. Hiaite Mosi leh Aron mah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Aigupta gam a Mosi kiang a Toupa’n thu a gen ni’n a kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Kei Toupa ka hi. Na kiang a ka gen tengteng Aigupta kumpipa Pharo kiang ah gen in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh Mosi in Toupa ma ah, “Ngai in, muk sumlouh ka hi a, bangchi’n Pharo in a hon ngaikhe dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “En in, Pharo ading in Pathian in k’on bawlta. Huchi in na unaupa Aron na zawlnei ahi ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu k’on piak tengteng na gen ding. Huchi in Aron na naupa in a gam apan a Israel suante sawlkhe ding in Pharo kiang ah a gen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pharo lungtang ka khauh sak dia, Aigupta gam ah ka chiamtehnate leh ka thillamdangte ka pungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh, Aigupta tung a ka khut ka ngak theihna ding leh ka sepaihte leh ka mi Israel suante, vaihawmna thupite a Aigupta gam apan ka pi khiak theihna ding in, Pharo in nang a hon ngaikhe kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta tung a ka khut ka likkhiak a, a lak ua pan Israel suante ka pikhiak chiang in, Aiguptate’n Kei, Toupa ka hi chih a thei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron in Toupa’n thu a piak bang in a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharo kiang a thu a genlai un, Mosi kum sawmgiat a upa ahi a, Aron kum sawmgiat leh thum a upa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron kiang ah thu a gen a, a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Pharo in na kiang ua nou ading in thillamdang suah un, a chih chiang in Aron kiang ah, Na chiang la inla, Pharo ma ah khia in, gul hongsuak hen, na chi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron Pharo kiang ah a lut ua, Toupa’n thu a piak bang in a hihta uhi. Pharo leh a sikhate ma ah Aron in a chiang a khia a, gul a hongsuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharo in leng mipilte leh bumsiamte a sam a; Aigupta mitkhialdawi tawite’n a mitkhialdawi un huchibang mah in a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau leng michih in a chiang uh a khia ua, gulte a hongsuak uhi. Himahleh Aron chiang in amau chiangte a valhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pharo in a lungtang a khauhsak a, amau thu a ngaikhe kei, Toupa’n a chih bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Pharo lungtang a khauhta a, mite paisak a nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zingsang in Pharo kiang ah hoh in. Ngai in, lui ah a hoh hi. A hongpai ngak in luigei ah na ding in. Na khut in huai chiang, gul hongsuak pen na tawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kiang ah, ‘Hebrute Toupa Pathian in na kiang ah a honsawl a, Gamdai a ka na a septheihna ding un, ka mite paisak in.’ Ngai in, tuma siah in na ngeingaih kei” a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichibang in Toupa’n a chi, “Hiai ah Toupa ka hi chih na thei ding. Ngai in, Ka khut a chiang in lui a om tuite ka sat dia, sisan a hongsuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lui a om ngasate a si ding ua, lui a uih dia; Aiguptate’n lui tui a dawn theikei ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a, “Na chiang la inla, Aigupta tuite tung ah, a tuinakneite tung ah, a luite uh tung ah, a tuichinte uh tung ah leh a tuilite uh tung ah, sisan a honsuah theihna ding un, Aigupta gam pumpi a singhawmte leh suanghawmte a sisan a om theihna ding in na khutlik khia in, Aron kiang ah chi in,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa thupiak bang in, Mosi leh Aron in a hih uhi. A chiang a liktou a, Pharo leh a sikhate mitmuh in, lui a om tuite a satta a, lui a om tuite sisan a hongsuak vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lui a om ngasate a si ua; lui a uih a, Aiguptate’n lui tui a dawn theita kei uhi. Aigupta gam pumpi ah sisan a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aigupta mitkhialdawi tawite’n leng a mitkhialdawi tawi un huchi mah bang in a hih uhi. Pharo lungtang a khauh a, Toupa’n a chih bang in amau a ngaikhe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pharo a kihei a, a inn ah a paita a, huai thil in a lungtang a khoih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aigupta tengteng in dawn ding zong in luikim a khuat uhi. Lui tui lah a dawn theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa’n lui a satnung ni sagih a hong chingta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a, “Pharo kiang ah hoh inla, a kiang ah hichi’n chi in, Toupa’n hichi’n a chi, ‘Ka na a hon sepsak theihna ding un, ka mite paisak in.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amau paisak na nial leh, ngai in, ukengte in na gam tengteng ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lui in ukeng a tam a tam a hon suahkhe ding ua, huaite a hong paitou ding ua, na inn ah a honglut ding ua, na lupna dansung ah, na lupna tung ah, na sikhate in ah, na mite tung ah, na thuk ah leh na tangbuang bawlna ah a hongom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ukengte nang tung ah leh, na mite tung ah leh, na sikhate tung ah a hong kaltou ding uhi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aron kiang ah, luinak neite tung leh, luite tung leh, tuichinte tung ah na chiang toh na khutlik inla, Aigupta gam tung ah ukengte hon paitousak in, chi in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aron in Aigupta luite tung ah a khut a lik a; ukengte a hong paitou ua, Aigupta gam a tuamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in mitkhialdawi tawite’n a mitkhialdawi un a hih ua, Aigupta gamtung ah ukengte a hon latou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaitak in Pharo in Mosi leh Aron a samsaka, “Kei leh ka mite apan ukengte a lakmang theihna ding in, Toupa ngen un. Mite ka paisak ding, Toupa kiang a kithoihna a bawl theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in Pharo kiang ah, “Ka tung ah kiuangsak in; Nang ading leh, na sikhate ading leh, na mite ading leh nang leh na innte apan, tui a a om theihna ding ua ukengte lakmang nadia chikchiang a hon ngetsak ding ka hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman, “Zingchiang in” a chi hi. Aman, “Na thu bang hi hen. Toupa ka Pathian bang kuamah a omkei, chih na theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang leh, na innte uh leh, na sikhate leh na mite apan ukengte a pawtkhe ding ua; lui kia ah a omta ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron Pharo apan a paikhia ua; Pharo gawtna dia ukengte a koih tungtang ah Toupa kiang ah Mosi a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi thu bang in a hihta a; innte leh, khuate apan leh loute apan ukengte a sita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a kaikhawm ua, a vum ua, gam a uihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh Pharo in a tung a zangta chih a theihin, a lungtang a khauhsaka; amaute a ngaikhe kei; Toupa gen bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aron kiang ah, Na chianglik inla, gam a leivui sat in, Aigupta gam pumpi a hik a hong omna ding un” chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchibang in, a hih ua; Aron in a chiang toh a khut a lik a, lei a leivui a sat a, mi tung leh sa tung ah hik a hong hita a; gam a leivui teng Aigupta gam pumpi ah hik a hongsuak vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mitkhialdawi tawite’n leng a mitkhialdawi un hikte omsak ding in huchibang in a hih ua, himahleh a hih theikei uhi. Huchi in mi tung leh sa tung ah hik a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaitak in mitkhialdawi tawite’n Pharo kiang ah, “Hiai Pathian khutzung ahi,” a chi uhi. Himahleh Pharo lungtang a khauhsak a, Toupa’n a chih bang in amau a ngaikhe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Zingkhang in thou inla, Pharo ma ah ding in. Ngai in, tuilam zuan a, a hong paikhiak in a kiang ah, Hichibang in Toupa’n a chi, Ka na a sep theihna ding un, ka mite paisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi lou a, ka mite na paisak kei leh, ngai in, na tung ah leh na sikhate tung ah leh, na mite tung ah leh, na inn sung ah thou honpi ka sawl ding. Huchi in Aiguptate innte thou honpi in a dim ding, a omna lei uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai ni’n ka mite tenna, Gosen gam ka sat khen ding, huai a thou honpi a om louhna ding in; Huchi a gam sung ah kei Toupa ka hi chih na theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mite leh na mite kikal ah kikhenna ka koih ding. Zingchiang in hiai chiamtehna a om ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchibang in Toupa’n a hih a; Pharo inn sung leh a sikhate inn sung leh, Aigupta gam tengteng ah, thou honpi lungkhamhuai tak a hongpaita a; thou honpi ziak in gam a segawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pharo in Mosi leh Aron a samsaka, “Pai unla, gam sung ah na Pathian kiang uah va kithoih un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mosi in, “Huchibang a hih a dik kei. Toupa ka Pathian uh kiang ah Aiguptate zakdah kithoihna lan ding ka hih ziak un. Ngai in, a muh ua Aiguptate zakdah kithoihna lan ding ka hi uh maw, suang in a hon deng kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gamdai ah ni thum lam ah ka pai ding ua, a hon thupiak ding bang a Toupa ka Pathian uh kiang a kithoihna bawl ding in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pharo in, “Gamdai a Toupa na Pathian uh kiang a na kithoih theihna ding un k’on paisak ding. Gamlapi pai kei peuh le uchin. Kei ading in hon ngetsak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi in, “Ngai in, nang apan ka paikhe dia, Pharo apan, na sikhate apan, na mite apan zingchiang a thou honpi a paimang theihna ding in Toupa ka ngen ding. Himahleh Toupa kiang a kithoih dia a mite paisak ding in Pharo lepchiahtak in gamta nawn kei hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pharo apan Mosi a pawtkheta a, Toupa a ngenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi thu bang in Toupa’n a hihta a; Pharo apan leh a sikhate apan thou honpi a lamangta a; khat lelleng a om nawnta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiai hun in leng Pharo in a lungtang a khauhsak a, mite a paisak nuamta kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Pharo kiang ah valut inla, Toupa Hebrute Pathian in, Ka na a sep theihna ding un, ka mite paisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute paisak na nial a, amau na let lailai leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa khut lou a om na bawnghonte tung ah, sakolte tung ah, sabiltungte tung ah, sangawngsaute tung ah, bawngtalte tung ah leh belamte tung ah a tu ding. Hipi se mahmah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n Israelte bawnghon leh Aiguptate bawnghon a satkhen ding. Israel suante a lam bangmah si a omkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n hun biseh a septa, zingchiang in Toupa’n gam sung ah hiai a hih ding” chi’n vagen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zing in Toupa’n hiai thil a hih a, Aigupta bawnghon tengteng a sita uhi. Himahleh Israel suante bawnghonte khat lel leng a si kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharo in mi a sawl a, ngai in, Israel bawnghon lak ah khat lel leng a sikei mahngei hi. Himahleh Pharo lungtang a khauh a, mite a paisak kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron kiang ah, “Meiphualpi vut na khutdim un la unla, Pharo muh in Mosi in vanlam ah theh hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah leivuinen a hongsuak dia, Aigupta gamsung teng ah, mi tung leh sa tung ah meimatum setak a honghi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meiphualpi a vut a la ua, Pharo mai ah a dingta uhi. Mosi in vanlam ah a thehtou a; mi tung leh sa tung ah, meimatum a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in meimatumte ziak in mitkhialdawi tawite Mosi ma ah ading theita kei ua; mitkhialdawi tawite tung leh Aiguptate tung ah lah meimatum a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n Pharo lungtang a khauhsak a, Mosi kiang a Toupa’n a gen bang in amau thu a ngaikhe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Zingkhang in thou inla, Pharo ma ah ding inla, a kiang ah, Toupa Hebrute Pathian in hichi in a chi, Ka na a sep theihna ding un ka mite paisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai hun in na lungtang tung leh na sikhate tung leh na mite tung a ka gawtna tengteng hontun ding ka hi ngal a. Lei pumpi ah kei bang kuamah a omkei, chih na theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin ka khut zankhia in nang leh na mite hipi in hon gawt leng lei apan satkhiat in na om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh hiai ziak in ahi, nang k’on tunding, nangmah a ka thilhihtheihna ka latsak theihna ding leh huchi a leitung tengteng a ka min a ki puankhiat theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaute paisaklou ding in, ka mite kalh in nang leh nang na kiliansak nalai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai in, zingchiang tu hun in a piantung a kipan tutan a om ngei nailou Aigupta gam ah gialpi petmah ka zusak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin mi sawl inla, lou a na neih tengteng leh na gantate kaikhawm in. Michih tung leh sa lou a kimu tung ah, in lam a hong kihawl lou tung ah, gial a hong kesuk dia, a si ding uhi” a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kuapeuh Pharo sikhate lak a Toupa thu laute’n a sikhate leh a ganta uh inn sung ah a hawllut uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa thu khawksa loute’n a sikhate uh leh a gantate uh lou ah a nusia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aigupta gam tengteng a, mi leh sa tung leh Aigupta gam tengteng a lou a haichi tung teng a gial a om theihna ding in, vanlam ah na khut zankhia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosi in vanlam ah a chiang a zankhia hi. Toupa’n van ging leh gial a honsawl a, leitung zui in mei a taita a; Toupa’n Aigupta gam tung ah gial a zu sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in gial a om a, gial toh kihel mei thupi mahmah, nam a hih nungsiah Aigupta gam a, huchibang om ngeilou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gial in Aigupta gamsungte a lou omte teng a dengta hi. Mi leh sa; lou a haichi chih gial in a dengta a, gam a singchih a kitansakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel suante tenna, Gosen gam kia ah gial a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pharo in mi a sawl a, Mosi leh Aron a sam sak a, a kiang uah, “Tutung in ka khialta. Toupa a diktat a, kei leh ka mite ka gilou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa ngen in, a hunta hi, vanpiging thupi leh gial thupi a om nawn louhna ding in. K’on paisak dia, na om nawn kei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi in a kiang ah, “Khopi apan ka pawt khiak chiang in Toupa lam ah ka khutte ka zak dia; vanpiging a dai dia, gial leng a om nawn kei ding; huchi a lei Toupa a a hih dan na theih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh nang leh na sikhate’n ahihleh, Toupa Pathian na lau naikei ding uh chih ka thei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pat leh barli buh den in a om a, barli buh a tuipumta a, pat a gah a takta ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Himahleh huitbuh leh buhman zaw den in a omkei; a nou lai ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pharo apan Mosi in khopi a pawt khiak san in, Toupa lam ah a khutte a zak a; vanpiging leh gial a dai a, lei ah vuah buak in a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pharo in vuah leh gial leh vanpiging a tawpta, chih a theih in, a khial tamsem a, amah leh a sikhate’n a lungtang uh a khauhsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in Pharo lungtang khauhsak in a om a, Mosi kam a Toupa’n a gen bang in Israel suante a paisak nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Pharo kiang ah lut in. A ma a hiai ka chiamtehnate ka etsak theihna ding in a lungtang, a sikhate lungtang toh ka khauhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tapa bil leh na tapa tapa bil a, Aigupta gam a bang thil ahia ka hih, a lak ua chiamtehna ka hihte na gentheih a, Toupa ka hi chih na theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron Pharo kiang ah a lut ua, a kiang ah, “Hebrute Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi. ‘Bangtan vei ka ma a kiniamkhiak nial ding na hia? Ka na a sep theihna ding un, ka mite paisak in.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi a hih kei a, ka mite paisak na nial leh ngai in, na tuipiau ah zingchiang in khaukhup k’on sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei mai a tuam ding ua, mite’n lei a mu theikei ding. A suakta bang a ne ding ua, gial in a hon hawisak teng, lou apan nang adia singpou chiteng a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na innte uah a dim ding ua, na sikhate innte leh Aiguptate innte leh leitung om apan tuni tan a na pate, na pate uh pate un a muh ngeilouh uh,” a chi uhi. Huchi in a kihei a, Pharo apan a pawtkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharo sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Bang tan hiai mipa ei adia thang hi ding ahia? Mite paisak in, Toupa a Pathian uh na a sep theihna ding un. Aigupta hihsiat in a om, chih thei nailou na hi hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron Pharo kiang ah a honpi nawn ua; aman a kiang uah, “Pai un, Toupa na Pathian uh na sem un. Himahleh a paidingte kuate ahi ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in, “Ka naupangte u toh, ka tekte utoh, ka tapate uleh ka tanute uh, ka ganhonte uleh ka belamhonte utoh ka pai ding uhi. Toupa kiang a Ankuangluina nei ding ka hih ziak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “ Toupa na kiang uah om hen, na numeite uh leh na nau neute uh k’on paisak leh, kiveng un, na ma uah gilou a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi hilou e, nou pasal piching teng kuan unla, Toupa na vasem un. Huailah na ut ngal ua” a chi hi. Huchi in Pharo apan delhkhiak in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aigupta gam tung ah khaukhupte a hong omna ding in na khut zankhia in. Aigupta gam a, a hong paitouh ua, gam a haichi teng, gial in a hawi teng tanpha a nek theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi in a chiang Aigupta gam tung ah a lik a, Toupa’n huai ni nitum in leh huai zankhua in suahlam huih a nungsak a; zingsang a hong hih in suahlam huih in khaukhup a hon tunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Aigupta gam tengteng tung ah khaukhupte a paitou ua, Aigupta gam tengteng ah a khawl ua: a chimtakhuai mahmah uhi. A malam uah huchibang khaukhup amau bang in a om ngeikei a, a nunglam uah leng huchibang a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leimai tengteng a tuam ziak un, gam a mialta hi. Gam a haichi chih gial in a hawi singgahte toh a ne uhi. Huchi in singte ah hiam, lou a haichite ah hiam leng thil hing a omta kei, Aigupta gamsung teng ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaitak in Pharo in kintak in Mosi leh Aron a samsaka; “ Toupa na Pathian leh nou tung ah ka na khialta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin, k’on ngen hi. Hiai tutung kia ka khelhna ngaidam inla, kei apan hiai sihna a lakmang theihna ding in, Toupa na Pathian kiang ah ngen in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Pharo apan a paikheta a, Toupa kiang ah a ngenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n suahlam huih hat mahmah a khahta a, huai in khaukhupte a lamang a, Tuipi San ah a lawnlutta hi. Huchi in Aigupta gam tengteng ah khaukhup khat leng a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n Pharo lungtang a khauhsak a, Israel suante a paisak nuamta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aigupta gam tung a khomial, khoihtheih ding mialsah a om theihna ding in, vanlam ah na khut likkhia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosi in vanlam ah a khut a likkhia a; huchi in ni thum sung Aigupta gam tengteng ah khomial bikbek a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kuamah a kimu tuah kei ua, a omna apan ni thum sung kuamah a thou kei uhi. Himahleh Israel suante tenna uah khovak a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pharo in Mosi a sam a, “Pai un, Toupa nna sem un. Na bawnghonte leh na ganhonte uh kia om uhen. Na nau neute un leng hon zui uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi in, “ Toupa ka Pathian uh kiang a ka kithoih theihna ding un, kithoihnate leh haltum thillatte leng na honpiak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka bawnghonte un leng a honzuih ding uh ahi. Nunglam ah chi in khat lel leng nawtsiat ahi kei ding. Huaite apan Toupa ka Pathian uh nasepna dia ka lak ding uh a hih ziak in. Huai mun ka tun masiah uh, bang in ahia Toupa nna ka sep ding uh, ka theikei uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n Pharo lungtang a khauhsak a, amau a paisak nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Pharo in a kiang ah, “Ka kiang apan paimang in. Kiveng in, ka mel mu nawn ken. Ka mel na muh nini a si ding na hih ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi in, “Na gen hoih e. Ka mel na mu nawn kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Pharo tung leh Aigupta gam tung ah gawtna khat ka tunlai ding. Huaikhit chiang in hiai apan a hon paisak ding. A hon paisak chiang in, a hon hawlkhe siang sipsip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin mite bil ah thu gen inla, pasal chih in invengte kiang ah ngen hen. Numei chih in invengte kiang ah dangka suangmantamte leh dangkaeng suangmantamte ngen hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n Aiguptate mitmuh in mite deihsakna a pia hi. Huailou in Aigupta gam ah leh Pharo sikhate mitmuh in leh mite mitmuh in Mosi a thupi mahmah hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi in, “Hiai bang in Toupa’n a chi, zankim chiang in Aigupta gamsung teng ka tawnsuak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta gam a piang masa tengteng, a mangtutphah a tu Pharo tapa masapen apan buhhek a om sikhanu ta masapen leh ganta piang masa tengteng toh a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta gam pumpi ah kahna thupi a om dia, huchibang om ngei nai lou, huchibang om ngei nawnlou ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Israel suante lak a kuamah siatna ding in, mi hiam gan hiam siatna ding in ui in a lei a tangsak kei ding a; Toupa’n Aiguptate leh Israel a khentuam dan na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in na milian tengteng ka kiang ah a hongsuk ding ua, a hong kun ding ua, ‘nang honzui mitengteng toh paikhia un’ a honchi ding uhi. Huaikhit chiang in ka paikhe ding” chi in hehtak in Pharo apan Mosi paikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Ka thillamdangte Aigupta gam a a punna ding in Pharo in a hon ngaikhe kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron in Pharo ma ah hiai thillamdang tengteng a hihta ua; Toupa’n Pharo lungtang a khauhsak a, gam apan Israel suante a paisak nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Aigupta gam ah Mosi leh Aron kiang ah thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai kha nou adia khate kipatna ahi ding. Nou ading in kum khat a a kha masapen ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel khawmpite kiang ah thu gen in, Hiai kha ni sawm ni’n a pipute inkuan bangzel in, michih in amah ading in belamnou a kilak chiat dia, in khat zel ading in belamnou khat zel ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Belamnou khat adia inkuan a tawmluat leh, a mi zah dungzui in amah leh a in zom a, invengte toh lakhawm hen. Michih in a kham ding bangzel in belamnou na sim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na belamnou uh gensiatbei, a pa kum khatna ahi dia; belamhon lak hiam kelte lak apan in hiam na la khe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai kha mah a ni sawmlehli tan na kem ding ua; nitaklam in Israel khawmpi omkhawmte’n a gou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sisan na la ding ua, a nekna ding in kongkhak biang khuam nihte ah leh kongkhak tung ah na tat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai zan in sa mei a hai, tanghou silngou sohlouh toh na ne ding uhi; lou kha toh na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sial nek kei unla, tuihuan hetkei un, a lutang, a khete, leh a sungkua toh mei in na haimin zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zingchiang tan in a bangmah na valsak kei ding uhi. A zingchiang tan a omlaite mei in na hal ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichibang in na ne ding uhi. Na kawng uh gaksa in, na khedap uh na khe ua bulhsa in, na khut ua na chiangkhunte uh tawisa in na kin nekding uhi. Toupa Paikan Ankuang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu zan chia Aigupta gam ka tawnsuak ding hi. Aigupta gam a piang masa teng, mi leh gan that ding ka hih ziak in. Aigupta pathian tengteng siatna ding in ka vaihawm ding hi. Kei Toupa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sisan nou ading in na omna innte uah chiamtehna ahi ding. Sisan ka muh chiang in, k’on Paikan dia, Aigupta gam ka gawt lai a, nou hon hihse ding in na tung uah hiai gawtna a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuni nou ading in theihgige ahi ding. Na khang teng un Toupa kiang a Ankuangluina in na nei ding ua; tangtawn in dan a Ankuangluina in na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sagih tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding ua; ni masapen ni ngei in na innte ua pan in silngou na koihmang ding uhi. Ni masapen apan a ni sagih ni tan, tanghou silngou sawh ne peuhmah, huai mi Israel apan satkhiak ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni masapen ni’n kikhopna siangthou a om dia, a ni sagih ni’n nou ading in kikhopna siangthou a om ding. Huai nite in nekbawl chihlouh ngal nna seplouh himhim ding ahi, Nek bawl kia na hihthei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuangluina na tang ding ua; hiai ni mah a Aigupta gam apan na mite uhi ka pikhiak ziak in. Huaiziak in tangtawn in na khang un dan in hiai ni na tang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kha khatna ah, huai kha a ni sawmlehli ni, nitaklam a kipan huai kha nitaklam a ni sawmnih leh khat matan in, tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na inn sung uah ni sagih silngou muh in a om ding ahi kei. Kuapeuh silngou sawh ne, huai mingei mi khual hiam hi in, a gamsung a piang hita leh Israel khawmpi apat satkhiat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Silngou sawh bangmah na ne ding uh ahi kei. Na tenna peuhmah uah tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosi in Israel upate a sam sak a, a kiang uah, “Na inkuan bangzel un belamnou kaikhia unla kilak unla, Paikan gou un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hussop gaklop na la ding ua, belkuang sung a om sisan ah na diah ding ua, belkuang sung a om sisan in kongkhak biang khuam tuak leh kongkhak tung na zep ding uhi. Zingsang masiah na lak ua kuamah a inn kongkhak ah a va pawtkhe ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aiguptate that dia Toupa hong paisuak ding a hih ziak in. Kongkhak tung a leh kongbiang khuam nihte a sisan a muh chiang in Toupa’n huai kongkhak a Paikan dia, honthat ding in na inn sung uah hihse mi a honglut a phalkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangtawn in na tapate uh ading leh nou ading in dan in hiai thil na tang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A chiam bang a, nou a honpiak ding gam, na tun chiang un, hichi ahi dia, hiai biakna thilzek in na nei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hichi a honghi dia, na tate un na kiang ua, Hiai biakna thilzek bang na chihna uh ahia? a honchih chiang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aiguptate a thah a, ei innte a tatkhiak lai a, Aigupta gam a Israel suante innte paikanpa, Toupa paikanna theihgigena ahi” na chi ding uhi. Huchi in mite’n a lutang uh a kunsak ua a beta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel suante a paimang ua, Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron thu a piak bang in a hih ua, huchibang in amau leng a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, zankim lai in Toupa’n Aigupta gam a piang masa tengteng, a mangtutphah tung a tu Pharo ta masapen apan suangkulh sung a om sal ta masapen tan in, ganhon nou masapen teng toh a thatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in zan in Pharo a thou a, amah leh a sikhate leh Aigupta tengteng. Aigupta gam ah kahna thupitak a omta a; inn khat mahmah mi khat sih louhna a omlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zan in Mosi leh Aron a samsaka, “Thou unla, ka mite lak apan paikhia un. Nou gel leh Israel suante pai un. Na gensa bang un, Toupa nna va sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na bawnghonte uleh na ganhonte u leng, na chih bang un, pi unla, pai un. Huchi in keileng hon vualzawl un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kintak a gam apan a sawlkhiak theihna ding un Aiguptate’n mite a nawh mahmah ua; “Mi sisa hivek ding i hi uh” a chih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mite’n a tangbuang uh silngou sawh ma in a la ua, a liangzang uah a tangbuang haihnate uh puan a khihsawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mosi thu bang in Israel suante a omta ua; Aiguptate dangka suangmantam leh dangkaeng suangmantam leh puansilh a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aiguptate mitmuh in Toupa’n mite deihsakna a pia a, a deih bang un huai thilte a kiang uah a pia uhi. Huchi in Aiguptate a lok uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israel suante Rameses apan Sukkoth a tung ua, naupangte simlouh pasal ngen khe a pai nuai guk ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mi kihelte’n leng bawnghonte, ganhonte leh ganta tampi mahmah toh amau a zuitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Silngou sohlouh a hih ziak in, Aigupta gam apan a honpuak uh tangbuang tanghou beu silngou sohlouh in a kang uhi. Aigupta gam apan hawlkhiak a om a, a tam theih nawnlouh ziak un, annek bangmah a kibawl kholh man kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aigupta gam a teng, Israel suante tamsung, kum za li leh sawmthum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum za li leh sawmthum bei in hichi ahi a, huai ni ngei in hichi ahi a, Aigupta gam apan Toupa’n mi tengteng a paikheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan amau a pikhiak ziak in Toupa ading in huai zan pilvangtak a tan ding ahi. Hiai Toupa zan Israel suante’n a khang a khang a, pilvang tak a tan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron kiang ah: “Hiai Paikan Ankuang dan ahi. Mikhual in hiai a neklouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Himahleh michih sikha sum a leisa, a zek na sum nung in hiai a ne thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Gamdangmi leh sikha goih in hiai a ne ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Inn khat a nekding ahi; inn apan sa, a bangmah na la thang ding uh ahi kei. A guh leng na hihtan ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel khawmpi tengteng in hiai a zuih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na kiang ua mikhual a om a, Toupa adia Paikan Ankuang a um ding leh, pasalte zeksum ding ahi, huaikhit chiang in hongpai nai uhenla, um uhen. Amah gamsung a piang bang ahi dia; zeksum louh mi in a nek louh ding a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Khotualmi ading leh na lak ua mikhual tam ading in dan khat a om ding ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Huchibang in Israel suan tengteng in a hih uhi. Toupa’n Mosi leh Aron thu a piak bang in a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Huai ni mah in hichi ahi a, Toupa’n Aigupta gam apan Israel suante a pawlpi in a pikheta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Piang masapen tengteng, Israel suante lak a sul hong peuhmah, mihing hi in ganta hita leh siangthou in sehtuamsak in, kei a ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi in mite kiang ah, “Hiai ni theigige un, Aigupta gam apan na hongpawt khiak ni uhi, saltanna inn apan na hongpawt khiak ni uhi. Khut thahat in Toupa’n hiai mun hontun lah ahi ngal a. Tanghou silngou sawh neklouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai ni, Abib kha in na hong paikhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi a honghi dia, Toupa’n Kanante, Hitte, Amorte, Hivte leh Jebuste gam nou honpiak dia, na pipute uh kiang a, a kichiamna, bawngnawi leh khuaizu a luang gam a hontut chiang in, hiai biakna thilzek hiai kha in na tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sagih tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding ua, a ni sagih ni’n Toupa ading in Ankuangluina a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sagih tanghou silngou sohlouh a kine dia; na kiang uah tanghou silngou sawh a kimu ding ahi kei. Na omna tengteng uah leng silngou muh in a om ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai ni’n na tapa na hilh dia. ‘Aigupta gam apan ka hong paikhiak lai a Toupa’n kei adia a thilhih ziak a hiai kihih ahi’ na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ban ah nang ading in chiamtehna ahi dia, na mitte kikal ah theihgigena, huchi a na Toupa dan na kam a a om theihna ding in Toupa’n ban thahat a Aigupta gam apan nou a hon pikhiak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in kum teng in a hunbi in hiai dan na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n , nang kiang leh na pipute kiang a, a kichiam bang a, Kanante gam a hontut chiang in, hiai a honpiak chiang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa ading in sul hong tengteng na koihtuam dia, na neih ganta apan hongom, a nou masapen teng; a pate Toupa a ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabiltung nou masapen teng belamnou in na tan dia; huchi a na tat kei leh, a ngawng na hektan ding. Na tapate lak a mihing tapa masa tengteng na tan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hun hongtung ding ah hichi ahi ding a, na tapa in, ‘hiai bang ahia? chi a a hondot chiang in, nang a kiang ah, Ban thahat in Toupa’n Aigupta gam apan, koltanna inn apan a hon lakheta’ a kiang ah na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Pharo in a hon paisak noplouh lai in, Toupa Aigupta gam a piang masa tengteng, mihing a piang masate leh ganta a piang masate a that hi. Huaiziak in sul hong tengteng, pasal hi in, Toupa kiang a ka lat ahi ua; himahleh ka tapate lak a piang masa tengteng ka tan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in na khut ah chiamtehna ding ahi dia, na mitte kikal a khaukhip ahi ding hi; Toupa’n Aigupta gam apan ban thahat a, a hon pikhiak ziak in” na chi ding hi..
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Pharo in huai mite a paisak lai in, Pathian in, nai zaw mahleh, Philistiate gamtawn in a pikei hi. Pathian in, “Kidouna a muh chiang un mite a kisik kha ding ua, Aigupta gam ah a kiheikik kha ding uh” a chih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in mite a pikual a, Tuipi San gamdai lampi tawn in a pi hi. Huchibang in Aigupta gam apan Israel suante a pawlpawl a kizawm in a paitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosi in Joseph guhte a pua hi. “Pathian in pellou in a hongveh dia; hiai apan ka guhte na puak ding uh ahi” chi a Israel suante chihtak tak a, a kichiam ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sukkoth apan a zin kheta ua, gamdai zul ah, Etham mun ah a giakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa a ma uah sun in meipi khuampi ding in, amaute lampi a pi ding in a pai a; zan in mei khuampi ding in, amaute vakna pe ding in; sun leh zan a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mite ma apan sun a meipi khuam ding ahihkeileh zan a mei khuampi ding a lamang ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel suante kiang ah thu gen in. Kihei uhenla, Pi-hahiroth ma ah, Migdol leh tuipi kikal ah, Baal-Zephon zawntak ah giak uhen. A ma ah tuipi kiang ah na giak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel suante tungtang thu, gamdai in a daltan ziak in gamsung ah a tang in buaigawp uh, Pharo in chi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaute nungdelh ding in Pharo lungtang ka khauhsak ding. Pharo tung leh a sepaihte tung ah zahtak in ka om ding hi. Huchi a Aiguptate’n Toupa ka hi, chih a theihna ding un” a chi hi. Huchibang in Israel suante’n a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite a paikheta uh, chih Aigupta kumpipa a hilh uhi. Pharo lungtang leh a sikhate lungtang mite siatna ding in hei in a om hi. “Eite na a sepna ua pan Israel i paisak uh, bangdia hiai hih i hi ua!” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kangtalai a mansak a, a mite a tonpihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kangtalai hoihpen za guk, Aigupta gam a kangtalai tengteng leh a heutute chiat uh toh a tonpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Aigupta kumpipa Pharo lungtang a khauhsak a; Israel suante a nungdelhta hi. Israel suante hangsantak in a paikheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh Aiguptate’n a nungdelh ua, Pharo sakol tengteng leh kangtalai tengteng, a sakol tungtuangmite leh a sepaih pawlte Baal-zephon ma a, Pi-hahiroth pam a tuipi kiang a a giahna uah a phata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharo in a honnaih lai in, Israel suante a daktou ua, ngai in, Aiguptate’n amau a hondelhta uhi. A lau mahmah ua; Israel suante Toupa kiang ah a kapkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosi kiang ah, “Aigupta gam a han a omlouh ziak a gamdai a si dia hon pikhia na hi maw! Bang achia hichibang a honbawl dia Aigupta gam apan hon pikhia na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta gam a k’on hilh uh hiai thu ahi kei maw? Om maimai ni, Aiguptate na i septheihna ding in, chi’n. Gamdai a ka sih sang ua, kou adia Aiguptate nasep a hoihzawk ding ziak in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi in mite kiang ah, “Lau kei unla, ding dinden un, Toupa hotdamna tuni a nou a hon etsak ding, en un. Tuni a na muh uh Aiguptate tangtawn a mu nawnlou ding na hih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n nou ading in a hon dousak dia, na paukei ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Bang a chia ka kiang a kap na hia? Malam a a paina ding un, Israel suante kiang ah thu gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na chiang lik inla, tuipi tung ah na khut zankhia inla, sat in. Huchi in Israel suante tuipi laizang ah leihul ah a paisuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai in, ken Aiguptate lungtang ka khauhsak dia; amaute a delhzui ding uhi. Pharo tung ah, a kangtalaite tung ah leh a sakol tungtuangmite tung ah zahtakhuaina ka kimuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pharo tung, a kangtalaite tung leh a sakol tungtuangmite tung a zahtakhuaina kakimuh chiang in, Kei Toupa ka hi, chih Aiguptate’n a thei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israelte giahphual ma a pai, Pathian angel a kisuan a, a nunglam uah a pai a; meipi ding a mailam ua kipan a kisuana, a nunglam uah a dingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aiguptate giahphual leh Israelte giahphual kikal ah a hong omta a; amau ading in meipi leh khomial ahi a; himahleh zan in hiaite ading in vak a pia hi. Huchi in zankhua in a kuamah a kinaihtuah thei zawsam a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosi in tuipi tung ah a khut a zankhia a; Toupa’n zankhua in suahlam huih hat in tuipi a paikik sak a, tuipi gam hul in a bawl a, tuite a kikhenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuipi lak a gam hul tung ah Israel suante a pai ua; a khut taklam uh leh a khut veilam uah amau ading in tuite bang a hong hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aiguptate’n a delh ua, Pharo sakol tengteng, a kangtalai tengteng, leh a sakoltungtuangmi tengteng nangawn tuipi lak ah amau nung ah a pailut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, zingsang a hong hih tak in Toupa’n mei khuampi ding leh meipi khuampi ding kawm ah Aigupta sepaihte lam a en a, Aigupta sepaihte a hihbuaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kangtalai khete uh a lakkhiak sak a, haksapi in a hawl ua; Aiguptate’n, “Israelte ma apan taikek ni. Amaute ading in Toupa’n lah Aiguptate siatna ding in a dousak ngal a” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Aiguptate tung leh, a kangtalaite tung leh, a sakol tungtuangmite tung a tuite a hongpai nawn theihna ding in, tuipi tung ah na khut zankhia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mosi in tuipi tung ah a khut a zankhia a, zingsang a hong hih in tuipi a hatna ah a hong kiknawn a; Aiguptate a lak ah a taikek ua; tuipi lak ah Toupa’n Aiguptate a thalpaihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuite a hong kiknawn ua, kangtalaite, sakoltungtuangmite leh Pharo sepaih a nung ua honglut tengteng tui in a khuhta hi. A lak uah khat lel leng dam a suakta omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh tuipi lak ah gam hul tung ah Israel suante a pai ua; a khut taklam uleh, a veilam uah tuite amau ading in bang ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchibang in Toupa’n huai ni’n Aiguptate khut apan Israelte a hondamta hi. Tuipi piau a Aiguptate si Israelte’n a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aiguptate tung a a nasep thupi Israelte’n a mu ua, Toupa leh a sikha Mosi a gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaikhit in Mosi leh Israel suante’n Toupa kiang ah hiai la a sa uhi: “Thupitak a, a vualzoh ziak in, Toupa kiang ah la ka sa ding. Sakol leh a tung a tuangmi tuipi ah a paikheta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ka hatna leh la ahi, ka hotdamna a honghi a; ka Pathian ahi, omna ka bawlsak ding. Ka pa Pathian, huchi in amah ka tawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa galhatpa ahi: Toupa a min ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pharo kangtalaite leh a sepaihte tuipi ah a paikheta: a heutute uleng, Tuipi San ah a kelum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukna in amaute a khuhta: Suang bang in a taw ah a tumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa aw, na khut taklam thilhihtheihna thupi a hong hita: Toupa aw, na khut taklam in melma a gawi zanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hoihna thupina in nang hondou dia thoute a zouta: na thangpaihna na sawlkhia a, huai in amaute buhpawl bang in a kangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na nakvangte mut in tuite kaihkhawm in a om ua, tui tampite vum bang a chian in a om, huchi in tuipi sunggil ah thuknate kipsak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Melma in, Ka delh dia, ka pha dia, gallak ka hawm ding: huaite ah ka duhgawlna a tai ding, ka namsau ka phawi dia, ka khut in amau ka hihgawp ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang na huih in na muta, tuipi in amau a khuhta hi; tui hatte ah ngen bang in a tumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang bang kua a om a? pathiante lak ah! Sianthouna a thupi, phatnate a lauhuai, thillamdang hih ah, Nang bang kua a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khut taklam na zankhia a, lei in amau a valhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tatsa mite nang na chitna in na pikhia a; na tenna siangthou ah na hatna in amau na pita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite’n a za ua, a ling uhi: Palestin a tengte nattom in a manta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaichiang in Edom hausate’n lamdang a sa mahmah ua: Moab a mi thilhihtheite, linna in a man; Kanan a tengte tengteng a zulmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Launa leh kihtakna a tung uah a hongtung; na khut thupina in suang bang in a dai uhi; Toupa aw, na mite’n a Paikan masiah uh, na leisa, na mite’n a Paikan masiah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na gouluah tang ah amau na hontun ding a, Na suan ding, Toupa aw, tenna ding a na kibawlna mun ah, Mun Siangthou ah, Toupa aw, na khut in a lamkipsa ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n tangtawn tangtawn in vai a hawm ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pharo sakol kangtalaite leh a sakoltungtuangmite toh tuipi ah a pilut a, Toupa’n a tung uah tuipi tuite a hon nilkhawm nawn a; himahleh Israel suante tuipi tung ah gam hul ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miriam zawlneinu, Aron sanggamnu’n khuangta a khut in a la a; numei tengteng in khuangta toh lamkawm in a nung ah a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miriam in amau a dawng a, “Thupitak a, a vualzoh ziak in, Toupa kiang ah la sa un; sakol leh a tungtuangmi tuipi ah a paikheta hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchibang in Tuipi San apan Mosi in Israelte a pi a, Sur gamdai ah a pai ua, gamdai ah ni thum a pai ua, tui a mu kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Marah a hongtun un, Marah tuite a khat ziak in a dawn theikei uhi; Huaiziak in a min Marah a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosi dem in mite a phun ua, “Bang dawn ding i hia!” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah a kap a; Toupa’n sing khat a ensak a, tui lak a a khiak leh, tui a hong limta hi. Huai ah amau ading in thuseh leh dan a bawl a, huai ah amau a enchian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Lungluttak a Toupa na Pathian aw na ngaihkhiak a, a mitmuh a dik na hih a, a thupiakte a bil na doh a, a thusehte na zuih leh, Aiguptate tung a ka tut, huai hite lak a a bangmah na tung ah ka koih kei ding. Nang hon hihdampa Toupa ka hi ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Elim, tuikhuk sawmlehnih omna leh tumsing sawmsagih omna a hongtung ua; huai a tuite kiang ah a giakta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Elim apan a zinzel ua, Israel suante Aigupta gam apan a pawt khiak nung uh a kha nihna, a ni sawmlehnga ni’n Israel suante Sin gamdai a tung ua, huai Elim leh Sinai kikal a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gamdai ah Israel suante omkhawm Mosi leh Aron dem in a phun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel suante’n a kiang uah, “Sa bel bulte a i tutlai un, kham tak a tanghou i neklai un, Aigupta gam ah Toupa khut in na sizaw maile hang. Hiai a omkhawm tengteng kial a honthat dia, hiai gamdai ah n’on pikhiak tak ziak un” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Ngai in, nou ading in van apan tanghou k’on zusak ding. Huchi in mite a paikhe ding ua, niteng daih ding bangzah zah hiam a lakhawm ding ua, ka dan ah a om uhiam omlou, amau ka etchian theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni guk ni’n, hichi ahi ding a, a honlakte uh a bawl ding ua; nitenga a lakkhawm uh mun nih a tam ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron in Israel suan tengteng kiang ah, “Nitaklam in huai hun in Toupa’n Aigupta gam apan a hon pikhia chih na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zingsang in, huai hun in Toupa thupina na mu ding ua; Toupa kalh a na phunnate u lah a zata ngal a. Kou bang ka hi ua, ka tung ua na phun uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosi in, Nitaklam a nekding sa, Zingsang a kham ding tanghou Toupa’n a honpiak chiang in hiai na mu ding uhi. Amah tung a na phunnate uh Toupa’n a zata ngal a. Kou bang ka hi ua? Kou kalh a phun na hi kei ua, Toupa kalh a phun na hizaw uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah thu a gen a, “Israel suan omkhawm tengteng kiang ah Toupa ma ah hong painai un. Na phunnate ulah a zata ngal a, chi in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Aron in Israel suan omkhawm tengteng kiang a thu a gen lai in, gamdai lam a et uleh, ngai in, meipi ah Toupa thupina a hong dawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel suante phunna ka za; a kiang uah thu gen in. Nitaklam in sa na ne ding ua, zingsang lam in tanghou na kham ding uhi. Huchi in Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, chih na thei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, nitaklam in vengkeng a hong kuantou ua, giahphual a hong tuamdim ua; zingsang in giahphual kimvel ah daitui a kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Daitui kia a om nawnlouh tak in, ngai in, gamdai pumpi ah thil bem neu, leitung a zingdai tuikhal ngou chia a neu, a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel suante’n a muh un, “Hiai Bang ahia?” a kichi tuah ua, bang ahia chih lah a thei ngalkei ua. Mosi in a kiang uah, Hiai Toupa’n a honpiak na nekding uh tanghou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Michih in a khamhun ding bang in la hen. Na mite uh zah dungzui in, michih ading in omer khat, la uhen chi a, Toupa’n thu a piak hiai ahi. Michih in a puanin a om ading in la un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel suante’n huchibang in a hih ua, a khen in tam deuh, a khen in tawm deuh a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Omer in a teh uleh a tamla in bangmah a nei valkei a, a tawm la in bangmah a tasam kei hi. Michih in a kham ding bangzel in a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosi in, Kuamah in zingsang tan nutsiat neikei hen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinapi in Mosi a ngaikhe kei ua; a lak ua khenkhatte’n zingchiang tan in a nusia ua, a than a, a uih hi. Huchi in Mosi a tung uah a hehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zingsang teng in, michih in a kham ding bangzel in a la ua; ni a hongsat chiang in a zul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni guk ni’n hichi ahi a, tanghou a mun nih a tam mi khat ading in omer nih zel a la uhi. Khawmpite heutu tengteng a hong ua Mosi a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Hiai Toupa chihsa ahi, zingchiang Toupa adia Sabbath siangthou khawlna ahi. Na kan nop uleh tuni in kang unla; na huan ding uleh huan un. A valte zingchiang tan ading in kikoih un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A zingchiang tan Mosi sawl bang in a koih ua, a uih kei a, than leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi in, “Tuni in huai ne un; tuni lah Toupa adia khawlni ahi ngal a. Tuni in gamlak ah tanghou na mu kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni guk na lakhawm ding ua; himahleh a ni sagih ni khawlni ahi, huai ni’n bangmah a omkei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a ni sagih ni’n lakhawm ding in mi khenkhat a paikhia ua, himahleh bangmah a mu kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Bang tan ka thupiakte leh ka dante zuilou ding na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En in, Toupa’n khawlni a honpiak ngal leh, a ni guk ni’n ni nih ading tanghou a honpia hi. Michih a mun ah om hen, a ni sagih ni’n a mun apan kuamah paikhe kei hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in mite a ni sagih ni’n a khawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel inkawte’n a min Manna a sa ua; sing namtui chi bang ahi, a ngou; chep in tanghou pei khuaizu sawh a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mosi in, “Hiai thil Toupa thupiak ahi. Na khang na khang ua ding in omer khat thundim un. Aigupta gam apan k’on pikhiak lai a, gamdai a k’on vakna tanghou a muhtheihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah, “Bel la inla, huai ah omer khat manna dim koih in, Toupa ma ah luikhia in, na khang na khang ua, zuihding in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in, Aron in Thukhun ma ah, koih ding in a luitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gam kiluah a hongtun masiah uh, Israel suante’n kum sawmli manna a ne uhi. Kanan gamgi a hongtun masiah uh, manna a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Omer khat, ephah khat mun sawm ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Israel suante omkhawm Sin gamdai apan a zin ua, Toupa thupiak bang a, a zin nung un Rephidim ah a puanin uh a kai uhi. Huai ah mite dawn ding tui a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaiziak in mite’n Mosi a kinakpih ua, “Ka dawn ding uh tui honpia in” a chi uhi. Mosi in a kiang uah, “Bangdia hon kinakpih na hi ua? Bangdia Toupa ze-et na hi ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite lah tuiduh in huai ah a dang uh a tak a; mite Mosi tung ah a phun ua, “Dangtakna a kou leh ka tate uh leh ka gante uh honthat dia, bangdia Aigupta gam apan hon lakhia na hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi Toupa kiang ah a kap a, “Hiai mite tung ah bang ka hihdia? Suang a hon denglum ding in mansa in a om uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Mite ma ah pai inla, Israel upate tonpih inla; lui na satna chiang na khut in tawi inla, pai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, Horeb ah suangpi tung ah na ma ah ka ding dia, suangpi na sat dia, huai apan tui a hong pawtkhe ding, mite’n a dawn theihna ding un” a chi hi. Israel upate muh in huchibang in Mosi in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai mun min Massah leh Meribah a sa hi, Israel suante’n Toupa tong in, Amah ze-et a, “I lak uah Toupa a om hia, omlou” a chih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaikhit in Amalek a hong kuan a, Rephidim ah Israelte a hong dou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in Joshua kiang ah, “Mi hon telkhia inla, pawtkhia ni’n, Amalek i dou ding. Zingchiang in ka khut a Pathian chiang tawi in tangvum ah ka kuan ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in a kiang a, a gen bang in Joshua in a hih a, Amalek a dou uhi. Mosi leh Aron leh Hur tang vum ah a hohtouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Mosi in a khut a liktouh chiang in, Israelte a hat ua; a khut a khiaksuk chiang in, Amalek a hat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh Mosi khut a gik a; huchi in suang a la ua, a nuai ah a koih uhi. Huai tung ah amah a tu a, Aron leh Hur in a khut a dop touhsak uhi. Khat, khat lampang ah, a dang, a dang lampang ah. Huchi in nitum matan a khutte a pangzou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Joshua in Amalek leh a mite a namsau in a zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Theihgige ding in hiai laibu ah gelh inla, Joshua bil ah gennawn in. Van nuai apan Amalek theihgigena ka koihmang sipsip ding ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosi in huai ah maitam a doh a, a min a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A khang a khang a Toupa’n Amalek dou gige ding chi a a kichiam ziak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jethro, Midian siampu, Mosi sungpan, Mosi ading leh a mi Israelte adia Pathian in a hih tengteng leh Aigupta gam apan Toupa’n Israelte a pikhiak dan a naza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Jethro, Mosi sungpan, Zipporah, Mosi zi, a sawlkik nung in a na kem hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zipporah tapa nihte toh. Huai nih lak a khat min Gershom ahi a, “Melmak gam ah mikhual ka na hi” a chih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dang min Eliezer ahi a, “Ka pa Pathian hon panpihpa ahi, Pharo namsau apan a hon tatkhiak ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jethro, Mosi sungpa a tapate leh a zi toh gamdai ah Mosi kiang ah a hong ua, Pathian tang a a puanin kaihna mun ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi kiang ah, “Kei na sungpa Jethro na kiang ah ka hong, na zi leh a kiang a a tapa nihte toh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi, a sungpa dawn ding in a pawtkhia a, a kuna, a tawp a; bang na chi uhiam chi’n a kidong ua; puanin sung ah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosi in a sungpa Pharo tung leh Aiguptate tung a Israelte ziak a Toupa thilhih tengteng leh lampi a haksatna a tung ua hongtung tengteng leh huaite apan Toupa’n a tatkhiak dante a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aiguptate khut apan a tatkhiak, Israelte tung a Toupa’n a hih hoihna tengteng ziak in Jethro a kipak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jethro in, “Aiguptate khut apan leh Pharo khut apan hon tankhepa, Aiguptate khutnuai apan a mite tankhepa Toupa’n nuamsa hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin pathian tengteng sang in Toupa a thupizaw, chih ka thei. Kisatheitak a Israel suante tung a thilhihte tung a hiai a hihtak ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jethro Mosi sungpan, haltum thillat leh thillat dangte Pathian ading in lan hi. Pathian ma a Ankuang umkhawm ding in Aron leh Israel Upa tengteng a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a zing in Mosi mipite vaihawm ding in a tu hi. Mipite zingsang apan nitaklam tan in Mosi kiang ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mosi sungpan Mosi in mite tung a a hih tengteng a muh in, “Mite tung a hiai thil na hih bang ahia? Bangdia tangtut na hia? Bangdia zingsang apan nitaklam tan a mite na kiang a ding uh ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosi in a sungpa kiang ah, “Pathian dong dia mite ka kiang a hongpai ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Haksatna a neih chiang un, ka kiang ah a hongpai ua; khat leh a dang kikal ah vai ka hawm a, Pathian thusehte leh a dante ka theisak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mosi sungpan a kiang ah, "Na thilhih a hoih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang leh na kiang a om hiai mite na segawp mahmah ding uhi. Nang adia hiai thil a gik luat ziak in, nang kia in na hih theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuin ka aw ngaikhia in, k’on thuhilh ding hi. Na kiang ah Pathian om hen. Pathian lam ah nang mite palai na hidia a thubuaite uh Pathian kiang ah na tun ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thusehte leh dante amau na sinsak dia, a paina ding lam uh leh a nasep ding uh toh na ensak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huailou in mite apan hithei, Pathian kihtakdan siamte, thutak mite, enna hawte na telkhe dia, amaute a tung uah na koih ding. Sangte vaihawmte, zate vaihawmte, sawmngate vaihawmte leh sawmte vaihawmte ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hun tengteng in amau mite vai hawmsak uhen. Hichi ahi dia, thu lian chiteng nang kiang a hongtun ding ua, thu neu chiteng amau a ngaihtuah ding uhi. Huchi in nang ading in a baihlam zaw dia, na puakgik a hon puakpih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiai thil na hih a, huchibang a Pathian in thu a honpiak leh, huchi in na pangzou dia, hiai mite leng lungkim in a mun uah a paiding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosi in a sungpa aw a ngaikheta a, a gen tengteng a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel tengteng apan Mosi in mihitheite a telkhia a, mite tung a lutang in a bawlta hi. Sangte vaihawmte, zate vaihawmte, sawmngate vaihawmte leh sawmte vaihawmte in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hun tengteng in mite vai a hawmsak ua; thu haksate Mosi kiang ah a tun ua, thu neute amau a ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in a sungpa a paisak a, a gam ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan Israel suante a hong paikhiak uh; a kha thumna, huai ni mah in Sinai gamdai a hongtung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rephidim apan pawtkhia in, Sinai gamdai a hongtung ua, gamdai ah a giak uhi. Huai ah Israelte’n tang mazawn ah puanin a kai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi Pathian kiang ah a hohtou a, Toupa’n tang apan amah a sam a, “Hichibang in Jakob inkawte kiang ah na chi dia, Israel suante na hilh ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aiguptate tung a ka hihleh muvanlai khate a k’on tuah, keimah kiang ngei kontut dan na muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin, ka aw na man taktak ua, ka thukhun na zuih taktak uleh, lei tengteng kei a a hih ziak in mite sang in kei ading in gou tuambik na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ading in siampute, lalgam leh nam siangthou na hi ding uhi. Hiai thute Israel suante kiang a na gen ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi a hong a mite upate a samsaka, Toupa’n amah a piak hiai thu tengteng a ma uah a luita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tengteng in kituaktakin a dawng ua, Toupa thugen tengteng ka hih ding uhi, a chi uhi. Mosi in mite thu Toupa kiang ah a tun nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Ngai in, na kiang ah meipi sah in ka hong, na kiang a thu ka gen chiang a mite’n a zak theih ua, chiklaipeuh a nang a hon gintak theihna ding un” a chi hi. Mosi in mite thu Toupa a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Mite kiang ah hoh inla, tuni leh zingchiang a ding in amaute siangsak in, a puante uh sawp uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni thumni ading in mansa in om uhen. A ni thum ni a mi tengteng muh a Sinai tangtung a Toupa a hong paisuk ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite kimvel ah dai na kai dia, tang a hohtou lou ding in pilvang un, ahihkeileh tang kim khoihlou ding in pilvang un. Kuapeuh tang khoih sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khut in a lawng ding uhi a hi kei, a lawng peuhmah suang a denlup ngeingei ahi dia; ahihkeileh kap pailet ahi ding. Gan hiam mihing hiam hileh leng, a hing kei ding. Pengkul sawtpi a gin chiang in, tang ah a hong tou ding uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tang apan mite kiang ah Mosi a paisuk a, a puante uh a sawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman mite kiang ah, “Ni thum ni ading in kisakhol un; na zite uh naihkei un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni thum ni’n zingsang in hichi ahi a, vanpi gingte leh khophiate, tang tung a meipi sah, pengkul aw a ngaiha ngaih a hongomta a, giahphual sung a om mi tengteng a lingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mosi in puanin apan mite Pathian toh kimu ding in a hon pikhia a; amau tang nuailam ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa mei a tangtung a, a hongkum ziak in Sinai tang a pumkhut vekta hi. Huai a meikhu meipi khu bang in a tungkaha, a tang pumpi a ling zungzung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sawtpi pengkul ging a ngaih semsem lai in Mosi in thu a gen a, Pathian in aw in amah a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sinai tangtung a tangvum tung ah Toupa a hong paisuk hi. A tangvum tung ah Toupa’n Mosi a samtou a; Mosi a hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Paisuk inla, mite vauhilh in. En ding in Toupa lam hong phuvang in a lak ua tampi a mangthang kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa kiang a hongpai, siampute leng, kihih siangthou uhen, huchilou in zaw a tung uah Toupa a puakzak kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosi in Toupa kiang ah, "Sinai tang ah mite a hongtou theikei ding uhi. Tang kimvel in daikai inla, hih siangthou in chi a, n’on hilh ziak in," a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, "Pai in, kumsuk in. Na hongtou dia, nang leh Aron na kiang ah. Himahleh siampute leh mite’n Toupa kiang a hong ding in hon phuvang kei uhen. Huchilou in zaw amaute tung ah a puakzak kha ding," a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi mite kiang ah a hohsuk a, a kiang uah thu a genta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Pathian in hiai thute tengteng a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei Toupa na Pathian uh, Aigupta gam a kipan leh saltanna inn apan hon pikhepa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah loungal a dang pathiante na nei ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milim gelhthoh himhim ahihkeileh tungvan a om thillim kibatpih mawngmawng hiam nuai lei a om hiam leinuai a tuisung a om kibatpih na kibawl ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kiang uah na kun ding ahi kei, a na uh leng na sem ding ahi kei. Kei lah Toupa na Pathian mullithat Pathian, kei honhawte khang thumna leh khang lina tan a, pate gitlouhna tate tung a thuk ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hon it a, ka thupiakte zuite lak a sang tampite kiang a hehpihna pia ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian min na mawk gen ding ahi kei. A min mawk genmi lah Toupa’n a mawhlou in a koih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sabbath ni theigige in, tang siangthou ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni guk sungteng nna nasem ding a, na nna tengteng nasep ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh a ni sagihna Toupa na Pathian khawlni ahi. Huai ah nna himhim; nang leng, na tapa in leng, na tanu in leng, na sikhapa hiam, na sikhanu hiam, na ganta hiam, na huangsung a om na mikhual hiam in leng a sem ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni guk ni’n Toupa’n lei leh van, tuipi leh asung ua om tengteng a bawl a, a ni sagih ni’n a khawl ngal a. Huaiziak in Toupa’n Sabbath ni a vualzawl a, a hih siangthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nu leh na pa zahtak in. Toupa na Pathian in a honpiak gam a na nite a sau theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tual na that ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ang na kawm ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na gu ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na inveng siatna ding in palai taklou na hi ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na inveng inn na eng ding ahi kei. Na inveng zi na eng ding ahi kei, a sikhapa leng, a sikhanu leng, a bawngtal hiam, a sabiltung hiam, thil himhim na inveng a peuhpeuh; a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tengteng in vanpi gingte, khophiate, pengkul husate leh tangkang khu a mu ua; mite’n huaite a muh un, a kisuan ua, gamlapi ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosi kiang ah, “Ka kiang uah thu gen inla, k’on ngaikhe ding uhi. Himahleh Pathian in hon houpih kei hen, ka si kha ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosi in a kiang uah, “Lau kei un. Amah launa na ma ua a om a, na khelh louhna ding un, Pathian nou hon enchian ding a hong ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mite gamla tak ah ading ua, Pathian omna mun mial bikbek lam ah Mosi a vapai nai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, Israel kiang ah hichibang in na chi ding. “Van apan nou k’on houpih na muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei lou dangka pathiante na kibawl ding uh ahi kei. Dangkaeng pathiante leng na kibawl ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei ading in lei maitam na bawl ding ua, huai ah na haltum thillatte leh na lemna thillatte, na belamte leh na bawngtalte na lan ding uh ahi. Mun tengteng a ka min ka khumna ah na kiang uah ka hong dia, k’on vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Suang maitam n’on bawlsak leh, suangsek a na bawllouh ding ahi. Suang tung a na vanzat na lik leh, na hihninta ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai a na vuaktanna a kimuhkhiak louhna ding in, ka maitam ah kalbi in na kahtou ding ahi kei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hiai vaihawmnate, a ma ua na ngak dingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebru sikha na lei leh, kum guk sung nang na a sem dia, a kum sagih na ah bangmah pelou in noplen in a pawtkhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah tuma honglut ahihleh, amah tum in a pawtkhe ding. Zi nei ahihleh, a zi in amah a zuikhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pu in zi a piak a, tapate hiam tanute hiam a neihsak leh, a zi leh a tate a pu a ahi ding ua, amah kia in a pawtkhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikha in teltak a, “Ka pu ka it, ka zi leh ka tate ka it; noplen in ka pawtkhe kei ding” a chih leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pu in vaihawmte kiang ah amah a pi dia; kongkhak chiang ah hiam kongkhak khuam chiang ah hiam a pi dia, a pu in vuhna in a bil a vut pailet ding. Huchi in aman a pu na a sem tawntung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Min a tanu sikhanu dia a zuak leh, sikhapate bang in a paikhe kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah khampa, a pu a lungkimsak kei leh, a pa a tankik sak ding. A tung ah muanhuailou tak a ahihleh melmak nam kiang a zuak ding in thuneihna a neikei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tapa zi dia a deih leh, tanute bang in a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman zi dang a neih thuah leh, a annek, a puansilh leh a piak ding a kilawm a sukkiam louh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tung a hiai thumte ahihkeileh, sum leh pai pelou in noplen in a pawtkhe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sihna dia mi vua peuhmah, sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi’n that ding in bukkei henla, Pathian in a khut ah pekhe zawta leh, a taina ding mun ka sehsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh zekhem a amah that ding in, mi’n a invengte tung ah maingaltak in gamta leh a sihna ding in, amah ka maitam apan na la dia, a sih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuapeuh in a pa hiam, a nu hiam vaw leh, sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuapeuh in mihing gu in zuak leh, ahihkeileh a khut ah muhkhiak in om leh, amah sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kuapeuh in a nu leh pa hamsiat sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mite kisual uhenla, khat in khat suang in deng hiam, a khuttum hiam in tum henla, silou in, lupna ngakta leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thounawn in, chiangkhun khun in kholak vak leh, a vawpa a hul dia; a hun sukbei man a pedia, amah a dam siangsak sipsip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi’n a sikhapa hiam, a sikhanu hiam chiang in sat henla, a khut lum in si leh amah gawt ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh ni khat hiam, ni nih hiam nung a dam a, a thohzoh leh, gawtlouh ding ahi; amah a pu neihsa a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mite kisual in, numei gailai hihna in, a nau tolh henla, himahleh siat detna in zuikei leh; numeinu pasal in a tung a, a chih bangbang a gawt ngeingei ding ahi. Vaihawmte’n a bikhiah bang uh a liau ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siatna mawngmawng in zuita leh hinna tang a hinna a piak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mit tang a mit, ha tang a ha, khut tang a khut, khe tang a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mei a hal tang a mei a hal, liam tang a liam, pawn tang a pawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi’n a sikha mit hiam, a sikhanu mit hiam suksak in, seta leh a mit ziak in noplen in a khah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sikhapa ha hiam, a sikhanu ha hiam sukheta leh, a ha ziak in noplen in a khah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawngtal in pasal hiam, numei hiam, si in, sita leh; huai bawngtal denlup ngeingei ding ahi. A sa neklouh hial ding ahi. Himahleh a bawngtal nei pen gawtlouh in a suakta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh huai bawngtal a malam a, a ki a misik hat hi a, a neitu kiang a hilhsa leng hinapi a, aman a na khum tuanlou ahihleh, pasal hiam, numei hiam a na siklup leh, huai bawngtal denlup ding ahi a; a neitu leng sihsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tung ah dangka sum a kiphut leh a kiphut bangbang a hinna tatna man ding in a pe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tapa hiam, tanu hiam a na sik leh, hiai vaihawmna bang a, a tung a hih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawngtal in sikhapa hiam sikhanu hiam a sik leh, a pu kiang ah dangka sekel sawmthum a pedia, bawngtal pen denlup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasal in kawkhuk sin hong henla, ahihkeileh pasal in kawkhuk tou henla, sin kei henla, asung ah bawngtal hiam sabiltung hiam ke leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kawkhuk neitu in a bawlhoih a, a neipa kiang a dangka sum a piak ding ahi. Huchi in a gan si pen amah a ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi khat bawngtal in midang khat bawngtal mah hihna henla, sita leh; a bawngtal hinglai pen a zuak ding ua, a sum a kihawm ding uhi. A bawngtal si pen leng a kihawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahihkeileh a malam a huai bawngtal sikhat ahi, chih a kitheih a, a neitu in a khum kei chih a kitheih leh; bawngtal tang a bawngtal a piak ngeingei ding ahi. Huchi in a gan si amah a tuam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi’n bawngtal hiam, belam hiam gu in gou hiam zuakta leh; bawngtal khat gun in bawngtal nga, belam khat gun in belam li a dit ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Guta inluh kimu in, kivua in sita leh a vawpa pen sisan suah chi a mawhsak theih ahi kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh a tung ah ni a suah nung ahihleh sisan suah chi a mawhpaih theih ahi ding. Ditna kim a piak ding ahi. Piak ding bangmah a neih kei leh, a guktak ziak a amah zuak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A van guk a khut a hinga a kimuh leh, bawngtal hiam ahihkeileh sabiltung hiam, ahihkeileh belam hiam hitaleh, a mun nih a piakkik ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi’n lou hiam, grephuan hiam nek a omsak in, a gan lutsak in, midang lou ah ta leh; amah lou hoihna pen leh amah grephuan hoihna pen apan ditna a bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mei hongkangin, linglak hong kuang in, buh hiam ahihkeileh hai ding lai hiam ahihkeileh lou kangse taleh; a mei khahpa’n ditna a bawl ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi’n a invengpa kep ding in dangka sum hiam van hiam pe khia henla, huai mi inn apan kiguta leh; guta a kimuh leh a zahnih pia hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Guta a kimuh kei leh, a invengpa van tung ah a khut a kha na hiam, chih theihna ding in inn neipa vaihawmte kiang ah a pi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tatlekna chiteng, bawngtal thu ah hiam, sabiltung thu ah hiam, belam thu ah hiam, puansilh thu ah hiam, van mang dan himhim hiam, midang in kei a ahi, a chih leh, a langtuak thu vaihawmmite ma a tut ding ahi. Vaihawmte mawhpaihpa’n a invengpa a lehnih a piak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi’n a invengpa kiang ah a kep ding in sabiltung hiam, bawngtal hiam, belam hiam gan himhim hiam pe khia henla; si hiam, liam hiam, hawlmang hiam a om in, kuamah in muta kei leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa kichiamna amau gel kikal ah a om dia; a invengpa vantung ah a khut a khakei chihna; a van neipa’n huai a pom dia, adin kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah apan guk a om leh, a neipa kiang ah ditna a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gan balnen in a na omta leh, a theihpihna ding in a sa hontawi hen, bohnen a om pen adin kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi’n a invengpa banghiam khel henla, a neipen omlouh kal in liam in hiam si hiam in omta leh, a dit ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh a neipa a kiang a om ahihleh adin kei ding. Van khelhman in adin khin lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khamsa hilou nungak siangthou khat pasal in zol henla, luppih leh, mouman pia in zi in a nei ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A numei pa’n a kiang a piak a nial bilbel leh, nungak siangthoute man dungzui in sum a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Numei mitkhialdawitawi a hin na phal ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ganta luppih peuhmah sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa kiang kia loungal, pathian himhim kiang a kithoih peuhmah hihsiat dimdem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mikhual na subuai hiam, na nuaisiah hiam ding ahi kei hi. Aigupta gam a mikhual na hihtak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meithai hiam, naupang paneilou hiam na hihgenthei ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangchi teng a amau na gentheih sak a, ka kiang a a hong kah peuhmah uh leh, a kahna uh ka ngaikhe ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka thangpaihna a sou dia, namsau in ka honthat ding hi. Na zite uh meithai ahi ding ua, na tate uh paneilou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na kiang ua om ka mite lak a mizawng kuapeuh kiang a sum na leitawi sakleh, leitawisakmi hih bang a sumpung na nek louh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kichiamna a na inveng puansilh na lak leh, ni tumma a amah kiang a na va piakkik ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai lah a kikhuhna neihsun ahi ngal a, a vun adia a puansilh ahi. Bang in a ihmu dia? Hichi ahi dia, ka kiang a, a hong kah chiang in ka za ding; hehpihthei ka hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian na kou ding ahi kei a, na mite vaihawmmi leng na hamsiat ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na theigah min masate, na uain masate lan ding in na zekai ding ahi kei. Na tapate lak a piang masapen kei n’on piak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in na bawngtalte lak ah leng na hih ding ahi. Na belamte lak ah leng hiai bang in na hih ding ahi. Ni sagih sung a pi kiang ah na omsak dia, a ni giat ni a kei n’on piak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kei adia misiangthoute na hih ding uh ahi. Huaiziak in gamlak a gamsa nek bang sa himhim na neklouh ding uh ahi a; uite na pe zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thutut zuau na genzak ding ahi kei. Theihpih diklou hi ding in migiloute toh na kizop ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gilou hih ding in mipi na zui ding ahi kei. Vaihawmna kaikawi ding in mi tam lamlam zui in amau na gum ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thubuai genna ah mizawng dou in guptuam na nei ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na melma bawngtal hiam sabiltung hiam taimang na tuah leh a kiang a na pinawn ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang hon haw mi sabiltung, a vanpuak lel a puk na muh leh taisan lou a, na panpih ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thubuai a kihekna ah mizawngte ading in thukhenna na kaikawi ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil diklou apan gamlapi ah om in. Thil hihkhial lou leh midikte that ken; migiloute siamtangsak lou ding ka hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Golhgukna na la ding ahi kei. Golhgukna in mit a tawsak a, midiktatte thu a kaikawi ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huailou in mikhual na hihgenthei ding ahi kei. Mikhual lungtang na theih ziak in, Aigupta gam ah mikhual in na om ngeita uhi, chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum guk sung na gam ah haichi na tuh dia, a gahte na lakhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh a kum sagihna na omsak kinken a, na khawlsak ding ahi; na mite lak a mizawngte’n a nektheihna ding un. A nutsiat peuh uh gamlaksate’n a ne ding uhi. Huchibang mah in na grephuan leh na olive huan tung ah na hih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni guk sung nangmah nna nasem dia, a ni sagih ni’n na khawl ding; na bawngtal leh na sabiltung a khawl ua, na sikhanu tapa leh mikhual a halh theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kiang a ka gen tengteng zui ding in pilvang inla; pathian dangte min louken, na kam apan zak in leng omkei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum khat sung in ka kiang ah Ankuangluina thumvei na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuangluina bawl in k’on thupiak bang in, Abib kha a hun sehsa in, ni sagih sung tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding ahi. Huai ni a Aigupta apan na hong paikhiat ziak in. Ka ma a kuamah khutvuak a a hong kilat ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawltak Ankuanglui, na sepgim gahte, lou a na tuh puaklutna Ankuangluina na bawl ding ahi. Na lou apan na sepgimna gahte na puaklut khit chiang in kumtawp ah, Puaklut Ankuanglui na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum khat sung in thumvei pasal tengteng Toupa Pathian ma a a kilat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka kithoihna sisan tanghou silngousoh toh na lat ding ahi kei. Ka kithoihna thau a zingsang chiang tan in a om ding leng ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian inn a na gam gah masapente lak a masapen na laklut ding ahi. Kelnou, a pi nawitui in na huan ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai in, lampi a nang honkem ding leh ka mun bawlsa a nang hontun ding in na ma ah Angel khat ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ma ah pilvang inla, a aw zui in, hehsak ken. Na tatleknate a ngaihdam louh ding ziak in. Ka min lah amah ah a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh a aw na zuih taktak a, ka gen tengteng na hihleh; na melmate tung ah melma ka hidia, nang hondoute tung ah doumi ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka Angel na ma ah pai dia, Amorte, Hitte, Perizte, Kanante, Hivte leh Jebuste lak a nang hon pilut ding ka hi ngal a; huchi in amau ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A pathiante uh ma ah na kun ding ahi kei. A na uh leng na sem ding ahi kei. A thilhihte bang uh leng na hih ding uh ahi kei. Himahleh amaute na zou siang sipsip dia, a milimte uh na hihzan dimdem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian nna uh nasem ding ua, aman na annek tuidawn uh a vualzawl ding hi. Huchi in na lak ua pan chinatna ka lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kuamah nausia a omkei dia, na gamsung uah kuamah a chingkei ding. Na nite zah uh ka tangtung sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na ma uah kei lauhna ka sawl dia, na hong tunna mi tengteng lak ah buaizakna ka omsak ding hi. Huchi in na melma tengteng nang apan ka taikek sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na ma ah khuaizanta ka sawl dia, huai in Hivte, Kanante leh Hitte na ma apan a hawlkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum khat sung in amaute na ma apan ka hawlkhe kei ding. A gam a hongvuak dia, noute hon hihse ding in gamsa a hongpung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na hongpun ua, gam naluah mateng, na ma ua pan amaute tawmkha kha in ka hawlkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuipi San apan Philistiate tuipi pha hial in, gamdai apan lui chiang pha in na gamgi ka khung ding. Na khut ua a gamluah mite k’on piak khiak ding ziak in na ma uah amaute na hawlkhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau toh hiam a pathiante utoh hiam leng thukhun na bawl ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na gamsung uah a teng ding uh ahi kei. Nang ka tung ah a hon khialsak kha ding uhi. A pathiante uh nna nasep uleh huaite nou adia thang a hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai nung in Pathian in Mosi kiang ah, “ Toupa kiang ah hongtou in, nang leh Aron, Nadab leh Abihu, leh Israel upate lak a sawmsagihte. Gamlapi apan in Pathian bia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosi kia Toupa kiang ah a hongpai ding. Himahleh amau a hongpai nailouh ding uh ahi. Mite leng amah toh a honghoh touhlouh ding uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi a hongpai a, Toupa thute leh vaihawmna tengteng mite a hilhta hi. Mite’n aw kituak in a dawng ua “ Toupa’n a chih thu tengteng ka hih ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa thu tengteng Mosi in a gelh a, zingsang in beltak in a thou a, tang nuai ah maitam a bawl a, Israel nam sawmlehnih dungzui in, khuam sawmlehnih a phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Israel suante lak a tangvalte a sawl a, amau Toupa kiang ah haltum thillat leh lemna thillat in bawngtalte a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi in bawngtalte sisan kimkhat a la a, kuangkum sung ah a koih a; a sisan kimkhat maitam tung ah a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thukhun Laibu a la a, mite zak in a sim hi. Mite’n “ Toupa’n a gen tengteng hih in a thu kamang ding uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosi in sisan a la a mite tung ah a theh a, “Thukhun sisan en un, hiai thu tengteng thu a Toupa’n a khun” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi, Aron, Nadab, Abihu leh Israel Upa sawmsagihte a paitou ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel Pathian a va mu uhi. A khepek nuai ah sapphir suangmantam a bawl hileh kilawm leh van bang a siang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Israel suante lak a upate dou in Pathian in a tung uah a khut a likkei hi. Amau leng Pathian mu napi in hingdam a om in ne in a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Tang ah ka kiang ah hongtou inla, huai ah om in. Suangpekte a ka gelhsa dan leh thupiakte k’on pe ding; amaute na sinsak theihna ding in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosi leh amah huhpa Joshua ading khia ua, Pathian tang ah a hohtou uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upate kiang ah, na kiang ua ka hong kiknawn masiah uh hiai ah hon ngak un. Ngai un, Aron leh Hur na ompih uhi. Mi kuapeuh in thubuai bangpeuh gen ding na neih uleh, amah a kiang uah honghoh hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosi tang ah a hohtou a, meipi in tang a khuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sinai tang tung ah Toupa thupina a om a, meipi in ni guk sung a khuh hi. A ni sagih ni’n meipi lak apan Mosi a samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangvum tung a Toupa thupina, Israel suante muh in kangmang thei mei bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Meipi lak ah Mosi a lutta a, tang ah a va hohtou hi. Mosi tang ah ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a va omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thillat a hontawi theihna ding un, Israel suante kiang ah thu gen in. Michih lungtang a uttak a pete apan thilpiak na la ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau apan thilpiak na lak ding hiai bang ahi. Dangkaeng leh dangka leh dal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puanmalngat dum, khau sandup, leh khau sanau leh khau hoih leh kel mul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Belampa vun sansaksa leh ngalvang vun leh singgi sing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vak ding in sathau, thaunuh ding gimlim, gim namtui ading toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Onik suangte, siampu puan leh awmtuamna a siat ding suangte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mun siangthou hon bawlsak uhen; a lak ua ka ten theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang k’on etsak bangbang in, biakbuk lim bang in leh a vanzat tengteng lim bang in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Singgi sing in thukhun bawm na bawl ding ahi. A dunglam tong nih leh a kim ahi dia, a vailam tong khat leh a kim ahi dia, a sanlam tong khat leh a kim ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in na luan dia, a sunglam leh a pawlam na luan dia, a kimvel ah dangkaeng lallukhu bawl in a tung ah na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dangkaeng in a sikkual li na sung dia, a ning lite ah na bulh ding. Sikkual nih a pang khat ah a om ding ua, sikkual nih dangte a pang khat ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Singgi sing chiang na bawl dia, dangkaeng in na luan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukhun bawm sik a sikkualte sung ah chiangte na thunlut dia, huaite thukhun bawn zawn a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chiangte thukhun bawm sikkual sung ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thukhun bawm sung ah ka honpiak theihsakna na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in chitna tutphah na bawl dia; a dunglam tong nih leh a kim ahi dia, a vailam tong khat leh a kim ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chitna tutphah mong nihte ah, dangkaeng in cherubte na bawl dia, huaite sekthoh in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mong khat ah Cherub khat na bawl dia, Cherub dang a mong langkhat ah. A mong nihte ah chitna tutphah ah cherubte na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cherubte’n tungsang lam ah a khate uh a zakkhe ding ua, a khate ua chitna tutphah tuam in, a mai un a ki en tuah ding ua; cherubte mai chitna tutphah lam ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thukhun bawm tung ah chitna tutphah na koih dia; thukhun bawm sung ah k’on piak ding theihsakna na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai ah k’on kimuhpih dia, chitna tutphah tung apan, theihsakna thukhun bawm tung a om Cherub nihte kikal apan Israel suante kiang a thupiak k’on piak ding thil tengteng thu ah, k’on houpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Singgi in dohkan na bawl dia; a dunglam tong nih ahi dia; a vailam tong khat, a sanlam tong khat leh a kim ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in na luan dia; a kimvel in dangkaeng lallukhu na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kimvel in a gei khut chia in na bawl dia; a kimvel in a gei ah dangkaeng lallukhu na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sikkual ding in dangkaeng in li na bawl dia; sikkualte a ning lite a khe li tung a omte ah na koih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dohkan puakna ding chiangte a omna ding in a gei chin ah sikkualte a om ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Singgi in chiangte na bawl dia, dangkaeng in na luan dia, huaite dohkan a kipuak theihna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kuangte, a keute, a sinte, a noute, a sitna ding in na bawl ding hi. Huaite dangkaeng tak in na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka ma a dohkan tung ah tanghou sawmlehnih na koih gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in khawnvak koihna na bawl ding hi. Khawnvak koihna sekthoh in na bawl ding ahi. A kungpi leh a hiangte, a pakmum leh a pakte, a kibang mah in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pangte apan hiang guk a kakhe dia; khawnvak koihna pang khat apan hiang thum, khawnvak koihna pang dang apan hiang thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Belkuang thumte makha bang a bawlte, hiang khat a pakmum leh pak; hiang dang a belkuang thumte makha bang a bawlte, pakmum leh pak; huchibang in khawnvak koihna apan a hongsuak hiang gukte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khawnvak koihna ah belkuang li makha bang a bawl a om ding ahi, a pakmumte leh pakte u toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huai mah a hiang nihte nuai ah pakmum khat a om dia, huai mah a hiang nihte nuai ah a pakmum khawnvak koihna apan a hongsuak khia hiang gukte dungzui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A pakmumte leh a hiangte a kibang ding ua: avek in dangkaeng tak a sekthoh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huai ah khawnvak sagih na bawl dia; khawnvakte a diam ding ua, a pang a vakna a piak theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A taitehte leh a meivukuangte, dangkaeng tak ahi ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />belsuan tengteng toh dangkaeng tak talent khat a bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tang a k’on etsak lim dungzui a bawl ding in pilvang in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailou in biakbuk puanmalngat hoih koptah puanzak sawm toh a dum leh a sandup leh a sanau na bawl dia; Siamtak a bawl cherubte toh na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puanzak khat saudan tong sawmnih leh giat ahi dia, puanzak khat zatdan tong li; puanzak chih in tehna khat a nei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puanzak ngate a kithuap khawmchiat ding uh ahi. Puanzak nga dangte a kithuap khawmchiat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kithuahna a a kipehna apan puanzak khat gei ah a dum in vang na bawl dia; huchibang zel in, puanzak dang mongchin mahmah ah, a nihna kithuahna ah na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puanzak khat ah vang sawmnga na bawl dia, a nihna kithuahna a om, puanzak mong ah vang sawmnga na bawl ding. Huchi a bangte a kimat chiat theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dangkaeng in kilhna sawmnga na bawl dia, kilhnate’n puanzakte nihnih in a kilhkhawm ding; huchi in biakbuk khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakbuk tungkhuhna ding in kel mul puanzakte na bawl dia; puanzak sawmlehkhat na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puanzak khat dunglam tong sawmthum ahi dia, puanzak khat vailam tong li; puanzak sawmlehkhat tehna khat ahivek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puanzak ngate amau mah in na thuapkhawm dia, puanzak gukte amau mah in, biakbuk mai ah puanzak gukna na khep ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thuahna a puanzak pawnung penpen mong ah vang sawmnga na bawl dia, a nihna thuahna puanzak mong ah vang sawmnga na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dal in kilhna sawmnga na bawl dia, kilhnate vang ah na guang dia, puanin khat a hih theihna ding in, na thuapkhawm ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puanin puanzak val omlai tum khatpen biakbuk phaitam a khai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puanin puanzakte dunglam a omlaite, a pang khatlam ah tong khat, a khuhna ding in hiai lam pang leh huailam pang a biakbuk pangte a khai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puanin khuhna ding belampa vun sansaksa leh a tungsawn khuhna ding in ngalvang vunte na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakbuk ading in singgi singpek tunna dingtang in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Singpek khat dunglam tong sawm ahi dia, singpek khat vailam tong khat leh a kim ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Singpek khat ah a tunna ding nih a om dia, kimuamtuah ding in lem in. Huchibang in biakbuk singpek tengteng ading in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biakbuk ading in singpek na bawl dia, simlam pang ah pek sawmnih ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Singpek sawmnih nuai ah dangka in kingakna khuakkuak sawmli na bawl ding. A kimuamtuah nihte ading in singpek khat nuai ah kingakna khuakkuak nih, a kimuamna nihte ading in singpek dang khat nuai ah kingakna khuakkuak nih na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biakbuk pang nihna ading in mallam pang ah singpek sawmnih a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A dangka kingakna khuakkuak sawmlite singpek khat nuai ah kingakna khuakkuak nih, singpek dang khat nuai ah kingakna khuakkuak nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Biakbuk pang tumlam a te ding in singpek guk bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pang nih ah biakbuk ningte ading in singpek nih na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nuailam ah a kithuapkhawm ding ua, sikkual khat ah a tunglam ah a kithuapkhawm ding uhi. Huchibang in amau tuak ading in ahi ding hi. Ning nihte ading in ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Singpek giat a om dia, a dangka kingakna khuakkuakte uhi, kingakna khuakkuak sawmlehgukte; kingakna khuakkuak nihte leh singpek dang khat nuai a kingakna khuakkuak nihte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Singgi sing chiangtawn na bawl dia; biakbuk pang khat a singpekte ading in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Biakbuk pang dang khat a singpekte ading in chiangtawn nga, biakbuk pang a singpekte, tumlam sik nihte ading in, chiangtawn nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Singpekte laitak a chiangtawn laita in mong khat apan mong khat tan a phak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Singpekte dangkaeng in na luan dia, chiangtawnte ading in dangkaeng sikkualte a munte ading in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tang a k’on etsak dungzui in biakbuk na dinsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Puanzak a dum, a sandup, a sanau leh puanmalngat hoih koptah siamtak a hih na bawl dia, cherubte toh bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Dangkaeng a luan singgi sing khuam lite tung ah na zak ding a; a bannate dangkaeng ahi ding a, dangka kingakna khuakkuak lite tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanzak kilhnate nuai ah na khai dia, huchi a huai a theihpihna bawm n’on lak lut theihna ding in. Puanzak in nang ading in Mun Siangthou leh Mun Siangthou pen kikal a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mun siangthou pen ah theihpihna bawm tung ah chitna tutphah na koih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puanzak pawlam ah dohkan na tung ding a; simlam ah biakbuk sik ah dohkan ngai in khawnvak koihna na koih ding. Mallam sik ah dohkan na tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Puanin kongkhak ading in puankhai na bawl ding, puanmalngat hoih koptah, phim a khui, a dum, a sandup leh a sanau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A khaina ding in singgi sing khuam nga na bawl dia, dangkaeng a luan, a bannate dangkaeng ahi ding uhi. Huaite ading in dal kingakna khuakkuak nga na sung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Singgi sing in maitam na bawl dia, tong nga a sau, tong nga a za; maitam detdou ahi ding. A sanlam tong thum ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ning lite tung ah a kite na bawl dia; a kite a kibang ding ua; dal in na luan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A meivu dohna ding belte na bawl dia, a luahna suahdul, kuangdal, keupi leh a sikkhut leh a meibel dai. A belsuan tengteng dal a na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ading in dal in singkhul ding koihna len bang in na bawl dia; a tung a ning li ah dal sikkual li na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nuailam maitam huapna nuai ah na koih dia; huchi a maitam laizanga, lente a kikim theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maitam ading in chiangte na bawldia, singgi sing chiangte dalin na luan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chiangte sikkual sung a thunlut ding ahi a; chiangte maitam sik nihte tung ah a om ding hi, a puakna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tang a k’on etsak bang in, singpekte ah a hawm na bawldia, huchibang in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biakbuk huang na bawl ding ahi. Simlam pang ading in simlam manoh in puankhai, huang umna ding in puanmalngat hoih sik khat ading in tong za a sau a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khuam sawmnihte leh a kingakna khuakkuak sawmnihte dal ahi ding ua; khuamte khainate leh puanduangte dangka ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in mallam pang ah a saulam tong za a sau puankhai a om ding, dalkhuam sawmnihte leh a kingakna khuakkuak sawmnihte dangka chi khuam, a khaina leh puanduangte ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tumlam pang a huang vailam ading in puankhai tong sawmnga a om ding. A khuamte uh sawm leh a kingakna khuakkuak sawm ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Suahlam a suahlam pang a huangsung umna vailam tong sawmnga ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kongpi sik khatlam a puankhaite tong sawmlehnga ahi dia; a khuamte thum, a kingakna khuakkuak thum ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Langkhat lampang ah puankhai tong sawmlehngate a om dia; a khuamte thum leh a kingakna khuakkuak thum ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huangsung kongpi ading in puankhai tong sawmnih a om dia, a dum, a sandup, a sanau leh puanmalngat hoih koptah, phim a khui ahi dia, a khuam uh li ahi dia, a kingakna khuakkuak li ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huangsung kimvel a khuam tengteng dangka puanduang a gak ahi dia, a bannate dangka ahi dia, a kingakna khuakkuak dal ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huangsung dunglam tong za khat ahi dia, a vailam tong sawmnga koipeuh ah, a sanlam tong nga puanmalngat hoih koptah a bawl, a kingakna khuakkuak dal ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakbuk a vanzat tengteng, a nasepna chiteng, a kilhbelhna sikzumte leh huangsung a kilhbelhna sikzum tengteng dal ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel suante meivak ding in olive thautak a bawl hontawi ding in thu na pe ding, khawnvak kuangsak gige ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Puanzak, theihpihna ma a om, pawlam a kikhawmte biakbuk ah, Aron leh a tapate’n Toupa ma ah nitaklam apan zingsang lam tan in thu a pe ding uhi. Israel suante ziak in a khang a khang un tangtawn a ding in thuseh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel suante lak apan na unaupa Aron leh a tapate siampu hi a ka na a sep theihna ding un la in. Aron leh a tapate: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar leh Ithamar na la ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thupina ding leh a kilawmna ding in na unaupa Aron ading in puan siangthou bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna kha a ka dimsak khutsiam tengteng kiang ah thu gen in, amau Aron puan, amah hihsiangna ding a bawltheihna ding un. Huchi a aman siampu nasepna mun a ka na a septheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puanbawl ding uh hiaite ahi: Awmtuam, siampupuan, puanaktual, puanakzem, lukhu leh kawnggak. Na unaupa Aron ading leh tapate ading in puan siangthou a bawl ding uh ahi, huchi a aman siampu nasepna mun a ka na sep a theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau dangkaeng, a dum, a sandup, a sanau leh puanmalngat hoih a la ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dangkaeng, a dum, a sandup, a sanau leh puanmalngat hoih koptah in hoihtak a bawl in, siampupuan a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A liang nihte gei nihte a kimat ding ua; a kimatkhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampu puanakzem gakna, puanduang kawnggak dangkaeng khau toh khau dum, khau sandup leh khau sanau siamtak a gat puanmalngat in a bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Onik suang nih na la dia, huaite tung ah Israel suante min na gelh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suang khat tung ah a minte uh lak a guk, suang dang tung ah, a omlaite min guk dangte, a piandan bangzel un na gelh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suainamna zungbuh khuakthoh a kigelh bang in, suang mantam khuak thoh a gelhsiamte gelh, huai suangmantam nihte ah Israel tapate min na gelh ding a, huai suang mantamte dangkaeng khuaksung ah na phum ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai suang nihte Israel suante adia theihgigena suang ding in siampu puan liangzang ah na koih ding. Huchi in theihgigena ding in Aron in a liangzang nihte tung ah Toupa ma ah a minte uh a paw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dangkaeng bulhna na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mongte a dangkaeng tak khainiang nihte; pakkhi bang in na bawl dia, a kibulhnate ah pakkhi bang khainiangte na khih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihawmna omtuamna siamtakin na bawl dia; siampu puan bawl bang in na bawl ding, dangkaeng in, a dum in, a sandup in leh a sanau in leh puanmalngat hoih koptah in, na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khep nih in a kikhep dia, a khep a dung a vai kikim, khap khat a sau leh khap khat a za ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaite tung ah suangmantamte na bulh dia, suang vual li in. A vual khatna sardi suang, topaz suang leh karbankul suang ahi ding. Hiai a vualkhatna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A vual nihna emerald suang, sapphir suang, leh diamond suang ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A vual thumna liguri suang, agate suang leh amethis suang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A vual lina beril suang, onik suang leh jasper suang ahi ding hi. A bulhna ua dangkaeng bulh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Suangte Israel suante min toh a kithuah dia, a min uh dungzui in sawmlehnih, chiamtehna gelhte bang in. Michih a min toh nam sawmlehnihte dungzui in ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Awmtuam tung ah pakkhi bang a bawl a mongte ah dangkaeng siang khainiang na bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Awmtuam tung ah dangkaeng sikkual nih na bawl dia, huai sikkual nihte awmtuam mong nihte tung ah na koih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Awmtuam mongte tung a om sikkual nihte ah dangkaeng pakkhi bang nihte na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pakkhi bang khainiang nihte mong nih dangte bulhna nihte ah na khih dia, a ma a siampupuan liangzangte ah na koih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dangkaeng in sikkual nih na bawl dia, huai gei a siampu puan mong nihte tung ah na koih ding, a sunglam a siampu puan gei a om pen ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dangkaeng in sikkual dang nihte na bawl dia, siampupuan gei nihte nuailam a a tung ah na koih ding, a malam sang a a kikhepna zawntak ah, siampu puan konggak lamdang tung tak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A sikkual in awmtuam siampu puan sikkual ah puanduang dum toh na hen dia, huchi a siampupuan kawnggak lamdang tung a a om theihna ding in leh siampu puan apan awmtuam a kiphellouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aron in, Toupa ma a theihgige tawntungna dia, Mun Siangthou a a lut chiang in, a lungtang zawntak ah vaihawmna awmtuam tung ah Israel suante minte a paw ding hi. siampu Puansilh Dangte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vaihawmna awmtuam ah Urim leh Thummim na koih ding. Toupa ma in a valut chiang in, Aron lungtang zawn ah a om ding hi. Huchi in Aron in Toupa ma ah a lungtang zawntak ah Israel suante vaihawmna a paw gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siampu puan puanaktual a dum in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A khung ah a awng a om dia; a laitak a, a awng kimvel ah gat thoh khihna a om dia, siklen puanak ban neilou hileh kilawm ahi ding, a kek louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A gei tung nuai ah, a dum in, a sandup in, leh a sanau in na bawl dia, a gei kimvel in. Dangkaeng dakte a kimvel in a kikal zel uah na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dangkaeng dak leh theibuhfai puanaktual gei tung ah a kivel in a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aron in na a sep chiang in huai a silh ding hi. Huchi in Toupa ma a Mun Siangthou a, a lut chiang leh a hongpawt chiang in a ging a kiza dia, a sikei chih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in kuang na bawl dia, a tung ah na gelh ding, suai namna zungbuh bang a khuak in, SIANTHOUNA TOUPA A AHI chih na gelh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huai laigelhna sikpek siampu dialkhip a, a mailam ah khau dum in na khihbelh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huai Aron taltang ah a om dia, aman Israelte thillat siangthou toh kisai a, Israel suante khelhna a paw ding ahi. Huai Aron taltang ah a om gige dia, thillat siangthoute Toupa mai ah san ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puanmalngat hoih puanak na gan dia, puanmalngat in lukhu na bawl dia, a gat thoh in kawnggak na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aron tapate ading in puanakte na bawl dia, kawnggakte na bawlsak ding. A thupina ding leh a kilawmna ding in lukhute amau ading in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huaite na unaupa Aron tung ah leh a kiang a a tapate tung ah na koih dia; amau thau na nilh dia, na septuam dia, na siansak ding ahi, siampu nasepna mun a ka na a sep theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A vuaktanna uh khuh ding in puan pheituam zumte na bawlsak dia; a tai apan a phei chiang a tun ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin a a lut chiang un hiam ahihkeileh Mun Siangthou a nasem dia dohkan kiang a, a hongpai chiang un, khelhna khatpeuh neih ziak a a sih louhna ding un huaite a sa tung uah a om gige ding ahi. Huchi in huai amah ading leh a nung a a suante ading in tangtawn a thuseh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, siampu a pang a, ka na sem ding a na siansakna dia hiai ahi a tung ua na hih ding, bawngtal nou khat leh belampa nih gensiatbei na la ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaiban ah tanghou silngou sohlouh, tanghou beu silngou sohlouh thau a zut leh tanghou pek silngou sohlouh thau a zut, huitbuh tangbuang in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaite lawh sung ah na koih dia, bawngtal leh belampa nihte toh, lawh in n’on tawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak ah Aron leh a tapate n’on pi dia, tui in amau na sil ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaikhit in siampu puansilhte na la dia, puanaktung leh siampu puanaktual leh siampupuan leh awmtuam Aron na silh sak dia, siamtak a kigan puanduang kawnggak in amah na gak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lu tung ah lukhu na koih dia, lukhu tung ah lallukhu siangthou na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thau nilh chi na la dia, a lu tung ah na buak dia amah na nuh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tapate n’on pi dia puanaktungte na silhsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kawnggak in amau na gak dia, Aron leh a tapate, lukhu bem na khu sak ding hi. Omden ding thuseh ading in siampu nasep amau a ahi ding. Hichibang in Aron leh a tapate na hihsiangthou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin ma ah bawngtal na kaisak dia; Aron leh a tapate’n bawngtal lu tung ah a khutte uh a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak kiang ah, Toupa ma ah bawngtal na gou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawngtal sisan na la dia, na khutzung in maitam kite na nuh dia, sisan tengteng maitam bul sik ah na sungkhe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sunglam tuam a thau tengteng na la dia, a sin tung a a lam om leh, a kaileng nihte, leh a tung ua a thau maitam tung ah na hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawngtal sa leh, a vun leh a ek, giahphual pawlam ah mei in na hal ding hi. Hiai khelhna thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Belampa khat na la dia, belampa lu tung ah Aron leh a tapate’n a khut uh a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Belampa na that dia, a sisan na la dia, maitam kimvel in na theh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Belampa na semnen dia, a sunglam na sawp dia, a khete leh a sate leh a lu na koihkhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Belampa avek in maitam tung ah na haltum ding ahi. Hiai Toupa adia mei a thillat gimnamtui ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Belampa dang na la dia; belampa lu tung ah Aron leh a tapate’n a khut uh a koih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Belampa na gou dia, Aron bil taklam dawn leh a tapate bil taklam dawn ah leh a khut taklam khutpi uah, a khe taklam khepi uah, a sisan na la dia, na nuh ding a, maitam kimvel ah huai sisan na theh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maitam tung a om sisan na la ding a, nuhtheih thau toh, Aron tung ah leh a puan tung ah leh a tapate tung ah leh a kiang a a tapate puan tung ah na theh ding. Huchi in amah leh a puante leh tapate leh a tapate puante hihsiangthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai Belampa thaute, a mei thau, asung thau, a sin leh a kailing nihte leh a thaute, a taklam phei toh na la ding ahi. Hiai bel siangthou a sehtuamna belampa a hih ziak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa mai a lawhbeu a om silngou sohlouh tanghou kikoihte lak a tanghou beu khat, sathau a kikang tanghou pei khat leh tanghou kan pek khat na la dia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aron khut leh a tapate khut ah na koih dia; huaite Toupa ma ah vei thillat in na vei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau khut apan huaite na sang dia, haltum thillat ding in maitam tung ah na hal ding ahi, Toupa ma a gimlim hi ding in. Hiai Toupa adia mei a thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aron hih siangthouna belampa awm na la dia, Toupa ma ah vei thillat in na vei ding hi. Hiai nang tan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai siangthou a sehtuamna belampa apan veithillat a veisa a awm leh vei thillat a veisa a phei, Aron tan leh a tapate tante na hihsiangthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiai Israel suante apan a Aron leh a tapate tan ngeina ahi gige ding ahi. Huai bel Israel suante’n a lemna thillatte ua pan Toupa adia a piak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aron puansilh siangthoute amah nung in a tapate a ahi ding uhi; Amaute a hih siangthou ding leh sehkip ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah mun a siampu honghi a tapa in Mun Siangthou a nasem dia Kihoupihna puanin sung a a lut chiang in, ni sagih sung huai puansilhte a silh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kihih siangthouna belampa na la dia, Mun Siangthou ah a sa na tuihuan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate’n belampa sa leh lohsung a om Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak kiang ah tanghou a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amau sehkipna ding leh hih siangthouna dia a khelhna thoihna thilte a nekding uh ahi. Thilzek leh siangthou a hih ziak in midang kuamah in a nek louh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kihihsiangthouna sa hiam tanghou hiam a zingsang tan a om leh mei in na hal ding ahi. A sianthou ziak in na ne ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchibang a thu k’on piak bangbang in Aron kiang ah leh a tapate kiang ah na hihdia, ni sagih sung amau na hihsiangthou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lemna thillat ding in niteng in bawngtal khat khelhna thillat ding in na lan ding ahi. Hiai adia lemna na bawlzoh chiang in, maitam na hihsiang dia, thau na nilh dia, na siangthousak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ni sagih sung maitam ading in lemna na bawl dia; na hihsiangthou dia; maitam siangthou pen ahi ding. Huai maitam khoih peuhmah a sianthou ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Niteng a maitam tung ah kum khat a upa belamnou nih na lat gige ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Belamnou khat zingsang in na lan dia; belamnou khat dang nitaklam in na lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Belamnou khat na lat chiang in tangbuang seh sawm suah, seh khat, a thau toh hin khat a seh lina toh dawn thillat ding in uain hin khat a seh lina na lan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Belamnou khat dang pen nitaklam in na lan dia, tangbuang thillat dungzui in, leh dawn thillat dungzui in gimlim ding in, na hihdia, Toupa adia mei a thillat gimnamtui ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na khang na khang un hiai Toupa ma a Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak a haltum thillat ahi nilouh ding ahi. Huai ah na kiang ua thugen ding in k’on kituahpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huai ah Israel suante ka kituahpih dia, ka thupina in biakbuk a hih siangthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin leh maitam ka hihsiangthou dia; siampu a pang a kei adia nasem ding in Aron leh a tapate leng ka hihsiangthou tuaktuak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huchi in Israel suante lak ah ka teng dia, a Pathian uh ka hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Toupa a Pathian uh, a lak ua ka ten theihna dia amaute Aigupta gam apan pikhepa ka hi, chih a thei ding uhi. Toupa a Pathian uh ka hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gimlim halna ding maitam na bawl ding ahi. Singgi sing in na bawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A saulam tong khat ahi dia; a zatlam tong khat mah. A saulam leh a zatlam a kikim dia, a sanlam tong nih ahi ding ahi. A kite leng a kibang in sa khat ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in naluan dia; a tung, a sikte leh a kite ah a kimvel in dangkaeng in a geivel na bawlding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dangkaeng sikkual nih a pang nih ading na bawl dia, maitam pang nihte ah na bulh dia, a zawnna zawlte khumna ding ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Singgi sing in a zawnna ding chiangte na bawl dia, dangkaeng in huaite na luan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />K’on kituahpihna ding mun, theihsakna tung a om chitna tutphah ma, theihpihna bawm kiang a om puanzak ma ah na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zingsang teng in huai tung ah Aron in gimlim a haldia; khawnvakte a det chiang in, a tung ah gimlim a hal ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitaklam a Aron in khawnvakte a det chiang in, a tung ah gimlim a hal ding. Na khang na khang un Toupa ma a gimlim ahi tawntung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ah theihlouh gimlim hiam haltum thillat hiam, tangbuang thillat hiam, na lan ding uh ahi kei. Huailou in huai ah dawn thillat leng na sung ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum khat in khatvei Aron in khelhna thillat sisan a kite ah a tat dia, lemna a bawl ding ahi. Na khang na khang un kum khat in khatvei a tung ah lemna a bawl ding ahi. Hiai Toupa adia siangthou pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaikhit in Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zah uh theihna dia kisimpina na bawl chiang in, pasal chih in a kha tatna sum Toupa kiang a a piak ding ahi. Hiai ahihleh amaute na sim chiang a a lak ua hipi a len louhna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Simtel a om michih in tatna sum a piak ding ahi. Mun siangthou sum sekel kimkhat ahi ding ahi. Sekel khat gerah sawmnih a gik ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Simtel a omte lak a paisuak peuhmah kum sawmnih a upa leh a tunglam in Toupa kiang a thillat a lat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kha ua ding a lemna bawlna dia, Toupa kiang a thillat a piak chiang un, a haute leh a zawngte’n sekel kimkhat sang a tam zaw leh tawm zaw a piak louh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai bang in Israel suante lemna sum na la dia, Kihoupihna puanin a nasepna ding in na sep ding ahi. Na kha uh tatna ding a, Toupa ma a Israel suante adia theihgigena a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kisilna ding in tuikuang dal in na bawl dia, a tunna khete leng dal in na bawl ding ahi. Kihoupihna puanin leh maitam kikal ah na koih dia, huai ah tui na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate’n a khutte uh leh a khete uh tui in a sil ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin sung a, a lut ding chiang uhiam, nasem dia Toupa mai a, mei a thillat lan dia maitam a naih ding chiang ua, a kisil ding uh ahi. A kisil kei uh leh a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai bang a, a sih louhna ding ua a khutte uh leh a khete uh a sil ding uh ahi. Hiai tangtawn in amau ading in thuseh ahi dia; a khang a khang un amah ading leh a suante ading nangawn in ahi ding ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen lai hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gimlim leng kilak inla, murra tui sekel za nga leh singguithak gimlim huaizah kimkhat, sekel za nih leh sawmnga sialluang khum sekel za nih leh sawmnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Singguithak sekel za nga, Mun Siangthou sekel dungzui in, olive thau hin khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nuhtheih siangthou in thau na bawl dia, nuhtheih damdawi misiamna bang a gawm; nilhtheih thau siangthou ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai in Kihoupihna puanin na nuh ding, theihpihna bawm toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A dohkan leh a belsuan tengteng leh khawnvak koihna leh a belsuan chiteng leh gimlim maitam toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Haltum thillat maitam leh a belsuan tengteng leh, tuikuang leh a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huaite na hihsiangthou dia; a siangthou pen hi ding in. Bang peuh huaite khoih a sianthou ngeingei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aron leh a tapate thau na nilh dia, amau na siangsak ding, siampu nasepna mun a kei adia na a septheihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel suante kiang ah thu na gen dia, na khang na khang un kei ading in hiai thaunilh siangthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing sa tung ah na buak ding uh ahi kei. A kihel khawm bang in a kibatpih dang himhim leng na bawl ding uh ahi kei. Hiai nilh siangthou ahi a, nou ading in a siangthou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hiai bangbang a hel a, a kibatpih sathau bawl hiam, siampu hilou midang tung a zang hiam kuapeuh a mite lak apan ka satkhe ding, a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huai ban ah Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah: Gimlimte, singnai, onicha, galbanum leh begaw a kikim chiat la in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hiaite apan gimnamtui na bawl ding ahi. Gimnamtui bawlsiamte hel bang na hel ding ahi. Chisoh, a siang leh a zek a siangthou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khenkhat na gawi zan mahmah dia, Kihoupihna puanin sung a theihpihna ma ah na koih dia, huai ah k’on kimuhpih ding hi. Hiai nang ading in siangthou pen ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na bawl ding gimnamtui toh kisai in, a helkhawm dan a a batpih nou aituam ding in na kibawl ding a hi kei. Nou ading in Toupa mai ah thil siangthou ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A gimnamtui napdia a batpih bawl peuhmah a mite apan ka satkhe ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En in, Judah nam a Hur tapa, Uri tapa Bezaleel a min in ka samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian Kha leh pilna leh theihsiamna leh theihna leh khutsiamna lam chiteng in amah ka dimsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman khutsiamna in thil lim leh mel nei in a gel dia, dangkaeng leh dangka leh dal in thil a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ban ah suangmantamte a at dia, singte lim leh mel nei in khutsiamtakin a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A seppih ding in Dan nam a mi Ahisamak tapa, Aholiab a kiang ah ka peta hi. Khutsiamna nei tengteng leng pilna lungtang ka peta a, amau nang k’on thupiak bang in thil tengteng a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin, theihpihna bawm, huai tung a om chitna tutphah leh puanin vanzat tengteng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dohkan leh a vante leh khawnvak koihna a van tengteng toh, gimlim maitam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Haltum thillat maitam, a van tengteng toh, tuikuang leh a khe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nasepna puante leh, siampu Aron puan siangthoute leh, a tapate puansilhte, siampu nasepna mun a nasem ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan nilhtheih thau leh Mun Siangthou ading gimlim a bawl ding ua, nang k’on thupiak tengteng bang in a hih ding uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel suante kiang ah thu gen in. “Chihtaktak a ka Sabbath na tan ngeingei ding uh ahi. Na khang ua kei leh nou kal a chiamtehna a hih ziak in. Nou honhih siangthou, Toupa ka hi, chih na theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Sabbath na tang ding ua; nou adia siangthou a hih ziak in. Kuapeuh hiai hihbuah sihsak ngeingei ding ahi. Kuapeuh hiai ni a nasem, a mite lak apan satkhiak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni guk sung nna septheih ahi dia; himahleh a ni sagihna Sabbath khawlni Toupa adia siangthou ahi. Sabbath ni a kuapeuh in nna khat peuh a sep leh, sihsak ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in Israel suante’n Sabbath ni a tang ding ua, thukhun tawntung hi ding in, a khang a khangun Sabbath a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai tangtawn in kei leh Israel suante kikal a chiamtehna ahi. Ni guk a Toupa’n lei leh van a bawl a, a ni sagih ni a khawl a, a tawldam ziak in,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sinai tangtung a Pathian in Mosi houpih a, thu a genkhit in theihsakna pek nih, suang pekte, Pathian khutzung a gelh, Mosi a pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tang apan Mosi a hong paisuk pahlouh mite’n a theih un, mite Aron kiang ah a hong kikhawm ua, a kiang ah, “Kisa in, ka ma ua pai ding, pathiante hon bawlsak in. Hiai Mosi, Aigupta gam apan hon pikhepa lah, bang chita ahia, ka thei ngalkei ua,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aron in a kiang uah, “Na zite uh bil a om, natapate uh bil a om, na tanute uh bil a om, dangkaeng bilbahte tolkhia unla, ka kiang ah hontawi un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tengteng in a bil ua dangkaeng bilbahte a tolkhia ua, Aron kiang ah a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman a khut ua pan huaite a la a, sunthoh bawngnou lim a bawl a, huai bang in dangkaeng bawngnou lim in asung hi. Huaikhit in amau, “Israel aw, Aigupta gam apan nang hon pikhia na pathian hiai ahi,” a kichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aron in huai a muhtak in, a ma uah maitam a bawl a, Aron in thuphuan a nei a, Zingchiang Toupa adia Ankuangluina ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zing in beltak in a thou ua, haltum thillat a lan ua, lemna thillat a tawi uhi. Mite ne ding leh dawn ding in a tu ua, noptal ding in ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Kumsuk in, na mi Aigupta gam apan na pi khiakte, a kihihsiat ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau ka lampi hilh apan a pialpah man hial uhi. Bawngnou lim sun a kibawl ua, huai a bia ua, a mai ah thillatte a lan ua, ‘Israel aw, hiai na pathian, Aigupta gam apan hon pikhetu ahi,’ a chi uhi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Hiai mite ka muta a, ngai in, mi genhakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin a tung uah ka thangpaihna a kuangzak a, amaute ka kattum theihna ding in hon khahzan in. Huchi in nam thupi in k’on bawl ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosi in Toupa a Pathian a ngen a, “ Toupa , thilhihtheihna thupi leh ban thahat a Aigupta gam apan na pikhiaksa, na mite tung ah bangdia na thangpaihna kuangzak ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangding in ahia Aiguptate’n thu gen a, ‘Hihse dia amau pikhia eive, tangte a amau that ding leh, lei tengteng apan amaute kangtum ding in?’ Na thangpaihna thupi lakik inla, na mite tung a hiai thil hoihlou na ngaihtuah kikhelsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kiang ua, ‘Van a aksite bang in na suante ka pungsak dia, na suante kiang a thu ka gensa, hiai gam tengteng ka honpe ding, huchi in tangtawn in na luah ding uh,’ chi a, nangmah ngei a na kichiamna, na sikhate, Abraham, Isak leh Jakob theigige in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a mite tung a thil hoihlou hihdia a ngaihtuah Toupa’n a kikhel sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosi a kihei a, tang apan a paisukta. A khut ah theihpihna suangpek nihte a om hi. Suang pekte a lang nihtuak a gelh ahi a, khatlam leh lang khatlam a gelh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suangpekte Pathian thilhih ahi a, a gelhte leng Pathian gelh ahi, suangpekte tung a gelhte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joshua in mite kikou husa a zak in Mosi kiang ah, “Giahphual ah kidouna husa a om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman, “Tungnun kituh a kikoute aw ahi kei a, nuaisiah a om ziak a kapte aw leng ahi kei. Lasate husa ahizaw ka zak,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, giahphual kiang a hong tuntakin, bawngnou leh lam a muta hi. Huchi in Mosi hehna a sou a, a khut apan suangpekte a pai a, tangnuai ah a keksakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bawngnou bawl uh a la a, mei ah a khul a, a gawinen a, tui tung ah a theh a, Israel suante a dawnsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosi in Aron kiang ah, “Hiai mite’n bang ahia na kiang a a hih uh, a tung ua hichitel a khelhna thupi na tunsak?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aron in, “Ka toupa mite na thei hi, thilsia a zon dan uh na hehna kuang kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka ma ua pai ding, pathiante hon bawlsak in. Hiai Mosi Aigupta gam apan hon pikhetoupa lah, bang suakta ahia ka thei ngalkei ua, ka kiang a a chih ziak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ken a kiang uah, Dangkaeng nei peuh in, hon tolkhia un, ka chi hi. Huchi in amau kei a honpia ua; ken mei sung ah ka khia a, hiai bawngnou lim a hong pawtkhia” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aron in a utut ua om dia mite a taizak uh phal in, melmate ma ah zahlak in a omsak, chih Mosi in a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Giahphual kongpi ah Mosi ading a, “ Toupa lam a pang kuakua ahia? Ka kiang ah hongpai hen” a chi hi. A kiang ah Levi ta tengteng a kikhawm khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman a kiang uah, “Israel Toupa Pathian in hichi’n a chi. Michih in a pang ah a namsau kuah henla, giahphual tuansuak in kongpi khat apan kongpi dang ah lut in pawt henla, michih in a sanggampa, michih in a lawmpa, michih in invengte that hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levi tate’n Mosi thu dungzui in a hihta ua; huchi in huai ni’n mite lak ah mi sang thum a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi in, “Michih in a tapa, michih in a unaupa douta na hih man un, a hon vualzawl theihna ding in tuni in Toupa ading in kihihsiangthou un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A zing in hichi ahi a, Mosi in mite kiang ah, “Khelhna thupi in na khialta uhi. Tuin Toupa kiang ah ka hohtou dia; na khelhna uh ading in lemna ka bawlthei maithei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosi Toupa kiang ah a kiknawn a, “Aw, hiai mite’n khelhna thupitak a hihta uhi, dangkaeng pathiante a kibawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi a lah, tuin, a khelhna uh ngaidam in-; Na ngaihdam kei ding leh, na gelhsa na laibu apan kei hon thaimang in, ka hon ngen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Kuapeuh ka tung a khial, ka laibu apan ka thaimang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin kuan inla, na kiang a ka genna mun ah mite pi in. Ngai in, na ma ah ka Angel a pai ding. Akoi abang hileh gawt dia ka veh ni’n a khelhna uh ziak in amau ka gawt ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in Aron in a bawl bawngnou mai a thil a lat ziak in Toupa’n mite hipi in a gawtta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaikhit in, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Kuan inla, hiai apan paitou in, nang leh Aigupta gam apan na pikhiak mite, Na suante kiang ah k’on pe ding, chi a, Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a ka kichiamna gam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ma ah ka Angel ka sawl dia; huchi in Kanante, Amorte, Hitte, Perizte, Hivte leh Jebuste ka hawlkhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngnawi leh khuaizu a luang gam ah hohtou un. Mi genhakte na hih ziak un, kei na lak ua hohtou lou ding ka hi. Huchilou in zaw lampi ah k’on kangtum kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite’n hiai thu hoihlou a zak un, a lungkham uhi. Huchi in mi kuamah kizepna a kizem a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n lah Mosi kiang ah, “Israel suante kiang ah, Mi genhakte na hi uhi. Mitphiat kallou a na lak ua hongtou a, hong kangtum thei ka hi. Huaiziak in na tung ua bang hih ding ka hia, chih ka theihna ding in na kizepnate uh suah un” chi’n, a na genkhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Israel suante’n Horeb tang ah a kizepnate uh a suahkhe vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi in puanin a sut a, giahphual pawlam, giahphual apan gamlapi ah a kai a, Kihoupihna puanin, a chi hi. Hichi ahi a, michih Toupa zongte Kihoupihna puanin, giahphual pawlam a om ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, puanin lam a Mosi a paikhiak teng in, mite avek un ading ua, michih a puanin kongkhak bul ah ading ua; puanin a a lut mateng Mosi a enzui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Mosi puanina a lut leh, meipi khuam a hong kuma, puanin kongkhak bul ah ading a, Toupa’n Mosi a houpihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tengteng in puanin kongkhak bul ading, meipi khuam a mu uhi. Mi tengteng ading ua a bia uhi, michih in a puanin kongkhak chiat ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi’n a lawm a houpih bang in, Toupa’n kimaituah in Mosi a houpih hi. Huchi in giahphual ah a kiknawn a, himahleh a sikha Joshua, Nun tapa, tangval, puanin apan a paikhe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosi in Toupa kiang ah, “En in, hiai mite hon pitou in n’on chi a, himahleh ka kiang a kua honsawl ding na hia chih n’on theisak kei. Hinapi inlah, Na min in k’on thei a, Ka mitmuh in hehpihna leng na mu hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />huaiziak in tuin, ka hon ngen ahi. Na mitmuh a hehpihna ka muh leh, nang k’on theihna ding leh na mitmuh a hehpihna ka muh theihna ding in, tuin na lampi hon ensak in. Hiai nam na mite ahi, chih ngaihtuah in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “Ka ompihna nang toh a ton dia, khawlna k’on pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Na ompihna kei toh a tonkei ding leh, hiai apan hon pitou ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />N’on tonpih kei leh, bangchi’n na mite leh ken na mitmuh in deihsakna ka mu uh chih kithei ding ahia? Leitung pumpi a teng mi tengteng apan kei leh na mite a tuam ka hi uh, chih bang in a kichiansak dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Ka mitmuh in deihsakna na mu a, na min in k’on theita a, hiai na nget pen leng k’on hihsak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman, “Ka hon ngen hi, na thupina hon ensak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman, “Na ma ah ka hoihna tengteng ka paisak dia, na ma ah Toupa min ka tangkoupih ding. ‘Ka hehpih nopmi, ka hehpih dia, chitna ka etsak nopmi, chitna ka en sak ding,’ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh ka mai na mu theikei ding. Mi, kei honmu, hing kuamah a omlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n , ‘En in, hiai ah ka kiang ah mun khat a om a; suangpi tung ah a na ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in hichi ahi ding, Ka thupina in honkhen sung in suangpi heng ah k’on koih dia, ka honkhen sung in ka khut in ka honkhuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaikhit chiang in ka khut ka lakhe dia, huchi in ka nunglam na mu dia; himahleh ka mai bel a kimu kei ding’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Amasa bang in suangpek nih bawl inla; hiai suangpekte tung ah, na hihsiat suangpek masapente a om thute ka gelh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingsang in mansa in om inla, zingsang in Sinai tang ah hongtou inla, tangvum ah ka kiang ah hong kihil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kiang a kuamah a hong touhlouh ding uh ahi. Tang kimvel a leng kuamah himhim muh a, a omlouh ding uh ahi. Tang mazawn lam a bawnghon leh belamhon leng a gamtat louh ding uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in suangpek nih a bawl a, a masapen bang in. Zingkhang in Mosi a thou a, Toupa’n thu a piak bang in, Sinai tang ah a hohtou hi, a khut in suangpek nihte a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa meipi ah a hongkum a, a kiang ah a hong dingta a, Toupa min a genkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in a ma ah Toupa a paisuak a, Toupa Toupa Pathian, hehpihthei leh itthei, dohthei leh, hoihna leh thutak hau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sangte adia chitna nei, gitlouhna, tatlekna leh khelhna ngaidam, mawhna bangchi mah a siang saklou ding, pate gitlouhna tate tung leh a tusuante tung ah, a khang thumna leh a khang lina tan a thuk” chi in a phuang khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kintak in Mosi leisi in a kunsuk a, a beta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman, “Tu a na mitmuh a hehpihna ka muh leh, Toupa aw, k’on ngen hi, Ka lak uah ka Toupa pai hen; mi genhak a hih ziak un. Ka gitlouhna uleh ka khelhna uh ngaidam inla, na gouluah ding in honla in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman: Ngai in, nou toh thukhun ka bawl hi. Lei tengteng a hih a om ngeilou, koi nam a leng hih a om ngeilou, thillamdangte na mi tengteng ma ah ka hih ding hi. A lak ua na tenna mi tengteng in Toupa’n nou adia thil lauhuai ka hih dingte a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang tuni a k’on thupiak zui in. Ngai in na ma uah Amorte leh Kanante leh Hitte leh Perizte leh Hivte leh Jebuste ka hawlkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na paina gam a tengte toh thukhun na bawlkha ding uhi, kiveng un. Huchilou in zaw na lak ua thang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A maitamte uh hihsia un, a milimte uh hih gawpsak un, a Aserah songte uh na phuksak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian dang na be ding uh a hi kei: Toupa , a min mullithat ahi, mullithat Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai gam a tengmite toh kikal ah thukhun na bawlkha ding uhi. A pathiante uh kiang ah kithoihna a lat chiang in khattei in a honchial dia, a kithoihnasa na nekha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tapate ading in a tanute uh na pisak khading ua, a tanute uh a pathiante uh kiang a a kizuak chiang un, na tapate uh leng amaute hih bang a, a milim pathiante uh be ding in a khempuk kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sunthoh pathiante na kibawl ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuangluina na nei gige ding uh ahi. Thu k’on piaktak bang in, Abib kha in, ni sagih sung tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding uhi. Abib kha a Aigupta apan a na hong paikhiak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sul hong tamasa tengteng, na ganhon lak ua piang masapen teng, bawngtal hi in belam hileh, a pa peuhpeuh kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh sabiltung nou masapen belamnou in na tan ding uh ahi. Na tat kei uleh, a ngawng na hektan ding uh ahi. Na tapate tengteng lak a piang masapen na tan ding ahi. Ka ma ah kuamah khutvuak in a hong kilang ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni guk sung nna nasem ding ahi. Himahleh a ni sagih ni’n na khawl ding ahi. Haichi pawi hun leh pawltak hun in na khawl ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nipi kalte a Ankuangluina, huitbuh pawltak gahmasa Ankuangluina, kumtawp a koihkhawmna ankuangluinate na tan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum khat in thumvei pasal tengteng Toupa Pathian, Israel Pathian ma ah a kilat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na mai ua namte ka delhkhe dia, na gamgi uh ka keklian ding. Kum khat a thumvei Toupa na Pathian ma a na kilat chiang un, kuamah in na gam uh a hon deihgoh kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka mai a kithoihna thillat; sisan silngou toh na lan ding uh ahi kei. Paikan Ankuanglui kithoihna leng a zingchiang tan in nutsiat in a om ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na gam a gah masapente a masapen Toupa na Pathian inn ah n’on tawi ding ahi. Kelnou a nu nawitui in na huan ding ahi kei, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, Hiai thute gelh in. Hiai thute omdan zui a nang leh Israel toh thukhun ka bawltak ziak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a om a; an a nekei a, tui leng a dawnkei hi. Suangpek tung ah thukhun thute, huai Thupiak Sawmte a gelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sinai tang a kipan a khut a theihpihna suangpek nihte tawia, tang apan Mosi a hong paisuk lai in, amah a houpih sung in a maitang a tang, chih Mosi in a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aron leh Israel suan tengteng in Mosi a muhtak un, ngai in, a maitang a tang a; amah naih a hongpai a lauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Himahleh Mosi in amau a sam a; Aron leh mipi kikhawmte heutu tengteng a kiang ah a hong kiknawn ua; Mosi in amau a houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huai nung in Israel suan tengteng a hongpai nai ua; Sinai tang a a kiang a Toupa’n a gen tengteng thupiak in amau a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosi in amau a houpih khitin, a maitang khuhna in a khuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa houpih dia a mai a lutteng in, a hongpawt khiak nawn mateng, a mai khuhna a hawkkhia a; thupiak a omte Israel suante kiang a a gen chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel suante’n Mosi maitang a mu ua, Mosi maivun a tang hi. Mosi in Toupa houpih dia a lut nawn matan in a maitang a khuh zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Mosi in Israel suan tengteng a khawmkhawm a, a kiang uah: Hiaite na hih ding ua Toupa thupiakte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni guk sung in nna sepzoh ahi dia, himahleh a ni sagih ni nou adia siangthou ahi ding hi. Toupa adia Sabbath khawlna ahi. Sabbath ni a nou adia in omni: Hiai ni nna sem peuhmah thah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sabbath ni’n na omna peuh uah mei na chih ding uh ahi kei, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel suan kikhawmkhawm tengteng kiang ah Mosi in thu a gen a: Toupa’n noute a hon thupiak hiaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa ading in na lak uah thilpiakte lakhawm un. Lungtang a utna nei kuapeuh in Toupa ading in thilpiakte: dangkaeng, dangka leh dal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau, puanmalngat hoih, kel mul;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />belampa mul diahsan, ngalvang vun, singgi sing;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />khawnvak ading thau, thaunilh ding in gimlim; hal namtui ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Onik suangte, siampu puanak leh awmtuam a siat ding suangmantamte hon tawikhawm uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lak ua khutsiam tengteng na hongpai ding ua, Toupa bawl ding chi a thu a honpiak tengteng a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakbuk, a puanin, a khuhna, a sikkawi, a singpekte, a sik tawnte, a khuamte leh a kingakna khuak kuakte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a bawm leh a chiangte, chitna tutphah leh a khuhna puanzak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dohkan leh a chiangte, a tuium-belsuan leh tanghou koihna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khawnvak ading in khawnvak koihna leng, a vante, a khawnvakte, a vakna thau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />gimlim maitam leh a chiangte, nilhtheih thau, gimlim leh biakbuk lutna kongkhak a dia puankhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Haltum thillatna maitam, a dal vutluah, a chiangte leh a tuium-belsuan tengteng, tuikuang leh a khe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a huangsung puankhaite, a khuamte, a kingakna khuak kuakte, huangsung kongkhak a dia puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biakbuk kilhna zumte, huangsung kilhna zumte leh a khaute;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nasepna puante, Mun Siangthou a nasepna dia siampu Aron puan siangthoute, a tapate puante bawl uhen, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Israel suan kikhawmteng Mosi omna apan a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Michih a lungtang tohthoh a om peuhmah leh michih utna nei peuhmahte a hongpai ua, Kihoupihna puanin lamna ding leh asung a nasepna ding leh puansilh siangthoute bawlna ding Toupa ma ah thilpiak a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lungtang a utna nei pasalte leh numeite a hongpai ua, dangkaeng a kibawl thil tuamtuam: bilbah, nakbah, zungbuh, awhthoh leh butthoh kizepnate, a hontawi ua, Toupa mai ah a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau, puanmalngat hoih, kel mul, belampa vun, ngalvang vun neite’n huaite a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thilpiak dia dangka leh dal neite’n Toupa mai a thillat ding in a hontawi uhi. Singgi sing neiteng in leng a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei khutsiam tengteng khut in khau a khek ua, a kheksa uh a hontawi ua, khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau leh puanmalngat hoih a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungtang tohthoh numei tengteng in kelmul a khek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vaihawm mite’n onik suangte, suangte, siampu puan leh, awmtuam a siat dingte a hontawi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />gimnamtui halding singgah namtui leh detding meivak leh nilh ding sathau a zat ding leh gimnamtui a hel ding sathau a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi tawn a thu a piak a, van bawl ding a chih tengteng bawlna ding in Israel suante, numei leh pasal te’n amau utthu in thilpiakte Toupa mai ah a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosi in Israel suante kiang ah: En un, Toupa’n Bezaleel, Uri tapa, Hur tapa, Judah nam a mi a min in a sam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian Kha leh theihsiamna leh theihna leh khutsiamna chi teng in amah a luahdim sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huai bel khutsiam tak a bawl dingte gelsiamna, dangkaeng leh dangka leh dal thilbawlsiamna ahi a, bulh ding suangmantamte atsiamna, singlam siamna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />bulh ding suangmantamte atsiamna, singlam siamna leh khutsiam thilbawl chi teng a siamna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hiai ban ah amah leh Dan nam a Ahisamak tapa Aholiab leng midangte sinsak siamna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amau teng khuakthoh a thilbawl siamna chikim leh khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau, puanmalngat hoih gat zep siamna, gat siamna, ze tuamtuam gelh siamna nei ding in pilna a pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai bang in Bezaleel, Aholiab leh Mun Siangthou vanzatte bawl ding dan thei ding a Toupa’n pilna leh theihsiamna a piak khutsiamte’n Toupa thupiak bang in vanzatte a bawl ding uh ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaikhit in Mosi in Bezaleel, Aholiab leh michih khutsiamna nei, a lungtang ua Toupa’n pilna a koih leh michih a lungtang ua nasem a kuan dia tohthoh a omte Mosi in a samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaute’n Mun Siangthou bawlna dia Israel suante’n a hontawi uh thilpiak tengteng Mosi apan a lata uhi. Huchi in zingsang teng in utthu a piak thillatte a kiang ah a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mun siangthou a nna tengteng sem, khutsiam teng a nasep chiat apan a hongpai ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi kiang ah, “ Toupa’n bawl dia a hon thupiak bang a nasepna dia hunzah sang a tamzaw mite’n a hon tawita uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosi in thu a pia a, giahphual teng ah a tangkoupih ua, pasal hileh numei hileh Mun Siangthou bawlna dia thilpiak kuamah in penawn kei un, a chi hi. Huchi in, thilpiak hontawi nawnlou dia kham in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mun siangthou bawlna a nna tengteng sepna ding in a van neihsa uh kiching in, a tam lawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nasemte lak a khutsiamte’n biakbuk khuhna ding siamtak a khui cherubte lim tuanna puanzak sawm, khau dum, khau sandup leh khau sanau khuk in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puanzak khat dunglam tong sawmnih leh giat ahi a; a vailam tong li; puanzak tengteng letdan a kikim chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puanzak ngate kithuah in a khep uhi. Puanzak dang ngate leng a khep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kithuahna mong khepna apan puanzak khat gei ah khau dum in bilte a bawl ua, huchi mah in a nihna khepna ah, puanzak dang gei chin ah bilte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puanzak khat ah a bil sawmnga a bawl ua, a nihna kikhepna a puanzak gei ah a bil sawmnga a bawl uhi. A bilte kizawn geihgeih in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dangkaeng in kilhna sawmnga a bawl ua, kilhnate in puanzakte a gawm khawm hi. Huchi in biakbuk khat a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puanin biakbuk tung ading in kelmul in puanzak a bawl ua; sawmlehkhat a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puanzak khat dunglam tong sawmthum ahi a, puanzak khat vailam tong li ahi. Puanzak sawmlehkhatte a lehlam a kibang vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Puanzak ngate amau in a kikhep tuam a, puanzak gukte amau in a kikhep tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kikhepna a puanzak mong chin ah a bil sawmnga a bawl ua, puanzak a nihna thuahna pen mong ah a bil sawmnga a bawl uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khat a hih theihna dia puanin kaihkhawmna ding in dal in kilhna sawmnga a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puanin khuhna ding in belampa vun diahsan in a bawl ua, huai tung ah ngalvang vun in khuhna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Singgi sing in biakbuk singpek ding a bawl ua, a tunthoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Singpek saulam tong sawm ahi a, singpek zatlam tong khat leh a kim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Singpek khat in atgek nih a nei a, a kigamlat dan uh kikim in huchibang in biakbuk singpek tengteng ading in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakbuk ading in singpek a bawl ua, simlam sang ah simlam pang ading in singpek sawmnih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Singpek sawmnih nuai ah dangkaeng in kingakna khuakkuak sawmli a bawl ua; a atgek nihte ading in singpek khat dang ah kingakna khuakkuak nih, a atgek nih ading in singpek dang ah kingakna khuakkuak nih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biakbuk pang khatlam ading in, a mallam ning a om ading in singpek sawmnih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A Dangkaeng kingakna khuakkuak sawmlite toh; singpek khat dang ah kingakna khuakkuak nih, singpek dang khat ah kingakna khuakkuak nih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tumlam biakbuk pang a te ading in singpek nih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A pang nihte ah biakbuk ningte ading in singpek nih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nuai ah a kithuah ua, a tung ah, sikkual khat ah a kikaikhawm ua; huchibang in a ning tuak ah a hih tuaktuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Singpek giat a om a; a kingakna khuakkuak uh dangka a bawl kingakna khuakkuak sawmlehguk ahi ua, singpek chih dang ah kingakna khuakkuak nih a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Singgi sing chiangtawn a bawl ua, biakbuk pang khat a singpekte ading in nga a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Biakbuk pang dang a singpekte ading in chiangtawn nga a bawl ua, tumlam pang a biakbuk singpekte ading in chiangtawn nga a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chiangtawn laita pen singpekte khat apan a dang kap paisuak in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Singpekte dangkaeng in a luan ua, a dangkaeng sikkualte uh chiangtawn omna ding in a bawl ua, chiangtawnte dangkaeng in a luan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau leh puanmalngat koptah hoih in puankhai a bawl ua; khutsiamtakin cherubte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Singgi sing in khuam li a bawl ua; dangkaeng in a luan ua, a bannate dangkaeng a bawl ahi. Huaite ading in dangka in kingakna khuakkuak li asung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Biakbuk kongkhak a ding in khau dum in, khau sandup in, khau sanau in leh puanmalngat hoih koptah, phim a khui in puankhai a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A khuam ngate a banna utoh; a zingte uleh a puanduangte dangkaeng in a luan ua: himahleh a kingakna khuakkuak ngate dal ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Bazaleel in singgi sing in bawm a bawl a, tong nih leh a kim a dunglam ahi a, tong khat leh a kim a vailam ahi, tong khat leh a kim a san lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in a sunglam leh a pawlam a luan a, dangkaeng lallukhu a kimvel in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dangkaeng sikkual li asung a, a ning lite a bulh ding in. A pang khat a sikkual nih, a pang khatlam ah sikkual nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Singgi sing in chiang a bawl a, dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chiangte bawm pang a sikkual sung ah, bawm puakna ding in a thun lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in chitna tutphah a bawl a; tong nih leh a kim a dunglam ahi a, tong khat leh a kim a vailam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dangkaeng sekkhiat in chitna tutphah mong nihte tuak ah cherubte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai lampang mong ah Cherub khat, huai lampang mong ah Cherub dang khat, chitna tutphah apan a mong langnihte ah cherubte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cherubte’n tunglam ah a kha uh a zak ua, chitna tutphah tunglam ah, a mai uh kingattuah in, a kha un a khuh ua; chitna tutphah lam ah cherubte mai a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Singgi sing in dohkan a bawl a; tong nih a dunglam ahi a, tong khat a vailam, tong khat leh a kim a sanlam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in a luana, a kimvel in dangkaeng lallukhu a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huailou in huai ah a kimvel in khutpek chia in a gei a bawl a; a kimvel in a gei ding in dangkaeng lallukhu a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dangkaeng sikkual li asung a, a khe lite a om a ning lite tung ah sikkualte a bulh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A geichin ah, dohkan puakna ding chiangte ading in mun, sikkualte a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Singgi sing in chiangte a bawl a, dohkan puakna ding in, dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dohkan tung a om tuium-belsuan a bawl a, a kuangte leh a sikkeute leh a noubemte leh a khuhna ding singte, dangkaeng tak in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawnvak koihna dangkaeng tak in a bawl a; sekthoh in khawnvak koihna a bawl hi: a kungpi, a hiang, a noubemte leh a mumte leh a pakte kibang chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pangte apan hiang guk a kakhia a; khawnvak koihna hiang thum a pang khat apan, a pang dang apan khawnvak koihna hiang thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noubem thum makha gah bang a bawl hiang khat ah, a mum leh a pak; noubem thum makha gah bang a bawl hiang dang ah, a mum leh a pak, huchibang in hiang guk teng ah khawnvak koihna apan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khawnvak koihna makha gah bang a bawl noubem li a om a; a mumte leh a pakte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kibang in hiang nihte dang ah mum khat, a kibang in hiang nihte dang ah mum khat, a kibang in hiang nihte dang ah mum khat, hiang gukte bangzel in a kakhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mumte uh leh a hiangte uh kibang ahi ua: avek un dangkaeng tak sekthoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawnvak sagihte, meihalnate leh meivukuangte dangkaengtakin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak talent khat in tuium-belsuan teng a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gimlim maitam singgi sing in a bawl a; a dunglam tong khat ahi, a vailam tong khat; kiptak a bawl ahi a; a sanlam tong nih ahi. A kibang vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in a luan a, a tung leh a kimvel in a pangte, a kite. Huailou leng a kimvel in dangkaeng lallukhu a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lallukhu nuai ah dangkaeng in sikkual nih a bawl a, a ning nihte kiang ah, a sik nihte tung ah, a puakna ding chiangte omna ding in. Gimnamtui leh Thau Nuh ding Bawlna
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Singgi sing in chiangte a bawl a, dangkaeng in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nilh theih thau siangthou, gimlim namtui siangthou, damdawimi hih bang in, a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Singgi sing in haltum thillat maitam a bawl a; a dung tong nga ahi a, a vai tong nga ahi a, a sanlam tong thum ahi. Kiptak a bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ning lite ah a ki a bawl a; a kite a kibang vek ua; dal in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuium-belsuan tengteng, maitam, belte, vutluahte, salu kuangte, sa thuknate leh meibel tengteng dal in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A laizangtak nuai ah a mong dang ah dal hakvang maitam ading in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chiangte omna ding in, dal hakvang mong lite ading in sikkual li asung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Singgi sing chiang a bawl a, dal in a luan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A puakna ding in, maitam pang a sikkualte sung ah chiangte a thun a; maitam singpek in asung a hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dal in tuikuang leh a khe a bawl a, numei kikhawm, Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak a kikhawmte limlangte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huangsung a bawl a; simlam pang simlam ah huangsung puankhai, puanmalngat hoih koptah, tong za khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khuamte sawmnih ahi ua, a dal kingakna khuakkuakte sawmnih; khuam bannate leh a dangka puanduangte uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mallam pang ading in puankhaite tong za khat ahi ua, a khuamte uh sawmnih leh, a dal kingakna khuakkuakte sawmnih; a khuamte a bannate leh dangka gaknate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tumlam pang ading in tong sawmnga a sau puankhaite a om ua, a khuamte sawm leh a kingakna khuakkuak sawm; a khuamte a bannate leh a dangka gaknate uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A suahlam pang suahlam ading in tong sawmnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kongpi sik khat a puankhaite tong sawmlehnga ahi ua; a khuamte thum, a kingakna khuakkuakte thum mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai lam sang leh huai lam sang a, huangsung kongpi sik khatlam pang ading in puankhai tong sawmlehnga ahi ua; a khuamte thum, a kingakna khuakkuakte thum mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huangsung a kimvel a puankhai tengteng puanmalngat koptah hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuam a kingakna khuakkuakte dal ahi ua; khuam a bannate leh a dangka gaknate dangka a zingte uh luanna; huangsung khuam tengteng dangka in a gaknate a kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huangsung kongpi a puankhai phim a khui, khau dum, khau sandup, a sanau leh puanmalngat hoih koptah ahi. A dunglam tong sawmnih ahi a, a pek sanlam tong nga ahi, huangsung puankhaite toh a kituak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khuamte li ahi a, a kingakna khuakkuakte li, dal a bawl. A bannate dangka a bawl, dangka a bawl a zingte leh a dung luante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biakbuk kilhnazum teng leh huangsung kimvel kilhna tengteng dal ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hiai biakbuk vankim, sim a om bang in, theihpihna biakbuk a te ngei, Levite nasepna dia, Mosi thupiak bangzel a siampu Aron tapa, Ithamar khut a bawl ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Bezaleel, Uri tapa, Hur tapa, Judah nam a mi in Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak tengteng a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah toh sem, gelh nasep siam, khau dum leh khau sandup leh khau sanau leh puanmalngat a zebawl siam, Holiab, Ahisamak tapa, Dan nam a mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dangkaeng tengteng Mun Siangthou a nasepna teng a sepna dia zat, thillat dangkaeng nangawn, talent sawmnih leh kua leh, sekel, Mun Siangthou a sekel dungzui in, za sagih leh sawmthum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dangka, khawmpi a simte talent za khat leh sekel sang khat leh za sagih leh sawmguk ahi, Mun Siangthou a sekel dungzui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi chih ading in beka khat, huai bel, sekel kimkhat ahi, Mun Siangthou a sekel dungzui in, michih sim a omte ading in, kum sawmnih a upa leh a tung lam, pasal nuai guk leh sang thum leh za nga leh sawmnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dangka talent za khat Mun Siangthou a kingakna khuakkuak ading in asung ua, puanzak a kingakna khuakkuakte toh; talent za khat adia kingakna khuakkuak za khat, kingakna khuakkuak khat adia talent khat zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sekel sang khat za sagih leh sawmsagih leh nga in khuam a bannate a bawl a, a zingte luan in a kimatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thillat dal talent sawmsagih leh, sekel sang nih leh za li ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaite in Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak kingakna khuakkuak a bawl a, dal maitam leh dal hakvang a bawl, maitam tuium-belsuan tengteng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huangsung kimvel a kingakna khuakkuak, huangsung kongpi kingakna khuakkuak, biakbuk kilhnazum tengteng leh, huangsung kimvel a kilhnazum tengteng a zou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khau dum leh khau sandup leh Khau sanau kigan in Mun Siangthou a nasepna ding siampu puante a bawl ua, Aron puansilh siangthoute a bawl uhi. Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang a bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau leh puanmalngat hoih koptah dangkaeng in siampu puan a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dangkaeng khau leh khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau leh puanmalngat hoih a kigan in siampu puanakzem a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nunglam leh malam kaihkhawmna ding, a liangzang ah kaihna a bawl ua, a tunglam gei tuak a khihkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tung a om, a siampu puanak siamnel tak a gat leng a kibang mah in a nasep dungzui in; dangkaeng, khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau leh puanmalngat hoih a Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak dungzui in gat in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Onik suang a bawl ua, chiamtehna gelhna a gelh, dangkaeng bulhna a bulh in, Israel suante min bangzel in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaite siampu puanak liangzang ah a koih ua, Israel suante dia theihgigena suangte hi ding in: Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khutsiamtakin awmtuam a bawl a, siampu puanbawl bang in. Dangkaeng, khau dum leh khausan leh khau sandup leh, khau sanau leh puanmalngat hoih koptah in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dung a vai a kikim a; awmtuamna thuah nih in a bawl uhi. A saulam khap khat ahi a, a vailam khap khat, thuah nih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ah suang vual li in a siat ua; a vual khatna sardi suang, topaz suang leh karbankul suang; hiai a vual khatna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A vual nihna, emerald suang, sapphir suang leh diamond ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A vual thumna, liguri suang, agate suang leh amethis suang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A vual lina, beril suang, onik suang leh jasper suang ahi a; a phuhna uah dangkaeng bulhna a siatlut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suangte Israel suante min bangzel leh a hihna zah uh bangzel in, sawmlehnih, chiamtehna gelhnate bang in, michih a min toh nam sawmlehnihte gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mongte ah awmtuam tung ah khainiang, dangkaeng tak pakkhi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in dangkaeng bulhna nih a bawl ua, dangkaeng sikkual nih toh: awmtuamna mong nihte ah sikkual nihte a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Awmtuamna mongte a sikkual nihte sung ah dangkaeng khainiang nihte pak bang a bawl in a thun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pak khainiang nihte mong nihte suangmantam bulhna nihte ah a koih ua, a ma ah siampu puan liangzang thuahna ah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dangkaeng in sikkual nih a bawl ua, awmtuamna mong nihte tung ah a koih ua, a gei ah, siampu puanak sunglam pang ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dangkaeng sikkual nih dang a bawl ua, nuai lam ah siampu puanak mong nihte ah a koih uhi, a malam sang ah, a kikhepna zawntak ah, siampu puanak kawnggak kigatthoh tung ah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gakna khau dum in siampu puanak sikkualte in awmtuam a gakden ua, siampu puanak apan a awmtuam a kiphel theihlouhna ding in; Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siampu puanak puanaktual gat thoh, avek a dum a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puanaktual laitak ah vanga om a, sikpuanak banbei vang bang in, a kek louhna ding a, a vang kimvel a kaihna khau a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puanaktual mongte ah khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau leh puanmalngat hoih in theibuhfai gahte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in dak a bawl ua, dakte puanaktual mong a theibuhfai gahte kikal ah, theibuhfai gahte kikal zel ah a khaisuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dak leh theibuhfai gahte nasepna ding a puanaktual mong kimvel ah Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aron leh a tate ading in puanmalngat puanak tung gat thoh a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Puanmalngat hoih in lukhu leh puanmalngat hoih in lutuam leh puanmalngat hoih koptah in puan pheituam gek a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kawnggak puanmalngat hoih koptah, khau dum, khau sandup, khau sanau, khuithoh in a bawl ua: Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dangkaeng tak in lallukhu siangthou a bawl ua, a tung ah laigelh, chiamtehna gelhnate bang in, SIANGTHOUNA TOUPA A AHI chih a gelh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huai ah khauhual dum a khih ua, lukhu tunglam gak toupek ding in; Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hichibang in khawmpite puanin biakbuk nasep tengteng zoh ahita hi. Toupa’n Mosi kiang a thupiak bang in Israel suante’n ahihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanin leh puanbuk van tengteng, a kibatnate, a singpekte, a chiangte, a khuamte leh kingakna khuakkuakte Mosi kiang ah a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A khuhna belampa vun diahsan leh, a khuhna ngalvang vun leh, a khuhna puanzak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Theihpihna bawm leh, a chiangte leh, chitna tutphah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Dohkan leh, a tuium-belsuan tengteng leh Pathian Ompihna tanghou sawmlehnihte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khawnvak koihna, khawnvakte, leh a tuium-belsuan tengteng leh khawnvak adia sathau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dangkaeng maitam leh, nilhtheih sathau leh, gimlim leh, puanin kong ading a puankhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Dal maitam, a dal hakvang, a chiangte, leh a tuium-belsuan tengteng tuikuang leh a khe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />huangsung puankhaite, a khuamte leh, a kingakna khuakkuakte, leh huangsung kongpi puankhai, a khaute, a kilhnazumte, leh biakbuk nasepna tuium-belsuan tengteng, kihoupihna puanin ading:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mun Siangthou a nasepna ding nasepna puan, hoihtak a bawlte, siampu Aron ading puan siangthoute leh, a tapate puante, siampu nasepna mun a nasepna ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in, huchibang in Israel suante’n na tengteng a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mosi in nasep tengteng a en a, ngai in Toupa thupiak bangtak in a hihta uhi. Huchi in Mosi in huaite a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah thu a gen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kha masa pen a ni masapen in Kihoupihna puanin biakbuk na ding sakta ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai sung ah theihpihna bawm na koih dia, bawm puanzak in na khuh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dohkan na la lut dia, a tung ah thil kizom a koih dingte kizom in na koih ding a; khawnvak koihna na lalut dia, a khawnvakte na det ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Theihpihna bawm ma ah gimlim adia dangkaeng maitam na koih dia, kongkhak puankhai biakbuk ah na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin biakbuk kongkhak ma ah haltum thillat maitam na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin leh maitam kikal ah tuikuang na koih dia, huai ah tui na koih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kimvel in huangsung na bawl dia, huangsung kongpi ah puankhai na khai dingtou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thaunilh nala dia, biakbuk na nilh ding a; huai sung a omteng teng toh, na hihsiangthou dia, a tuium-belsuan tengteng a siangthou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Haltum thillat maitam na nilh ding a; a tuium-belsuan tengteng toh, maitam na siangthousak ding. Huchi in maitam a siangthou penpen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuikuang leh a khe na nilh dia, na siangsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak ah Aron leh a tapate na honpi dia, tui in na sil ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puan siangthoute Aron na silhsak dia, na nilh dia, na siangthousak ding ahi; siampu nasepna mun a ka na a sep theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tapate n’on tonpih dia, puanak tung na silhsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pa uh sathau na nilh bang in amau siampu nasepna mun a, ka na a sep theihna ding un thau na nilh ding ahi. A thaunilhna uh a khangkhang ua siampu hihna a hih taktak ding ziak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai bang in Mosi in a hihta a; Toupa’n amah thu a piak bangzel in ahi, a hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a kum nihna, a kha masa pen, a kha a ni masapen ni’n, biakbuk dinsak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosi in biakbuk ading sakta a, a kingakna khuakkuakte a hen a, a singpekte a tung a, a chiangte a thunlut a, a khuamte a dingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakbuk tung ah puanin a zalhta a; a tunglam ah puanin khuhna a koih a; Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Theihpihna a la a bawm sung ah a koih a, chiangte bawm tung ah a koih a; bawm tung lam ah chitna tutphah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawm biakbuk sung ah a tawiluta, khuhna puanzak a zak a, theihpihna bawm a khuh hi. Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin sung ah dohkan a koih a, biakbuk pang mallam, puanzak pawlam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa ma ah dohkan tung ah tanghoute kizom in a koih a; Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin sung ah dohkan zawn ah, biakbuk sik simlam pang ah khawnvak koihna a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in Toupa ma ah khawnvakte a deta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan puanzak ma ah kihoupihna puanin sung ah dangkaeng maitam a koih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai tung ah namtui a hal a; Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Biakbuk kongkhak ah puankhai a khai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin biakbuk kongkhak kiang ah Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in haltum thillat leh tangbuang thillat a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin leh maitam kikal ah tuikuang a koih a, huai ah tui a koih a, kisawpna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron leh a tapate’n a khutte uh leh a khepekte uh huai ah a sil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kihoupihna puanin sung ah a hoh ua, maitam kiang ah a hongpai nai ua Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a kisil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Biakbuk leh maitam kimvel in huangsung a bawl a, huangsung kongpi puankhaite a khaita hi. Huchi in Mosi in nasep a zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huaikhit in meipi in Kihoupihna puanin a tuam a, Toupa thupina in biakbuk a dimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in Kihoupihna puanin sung ah Mosi a lut theita kei, a tung a meipi a kai ziak in leh, Toupa thupina in biakbuk a dimsak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Biakbuk tung apan meipi laktouh a, a om chiang in, Israel suante a khualzinna uah malam ah a pai zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Himahleh meipi lak touh a, a omlouh chiang in, a kilak touh louh ni’n a zinkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A khualzin sung teng uh Israel inn kawte mitmuh in sun in Toupa meipi biakbuk tung ah a om a, zan in biakbuk tung ah meikuang in a om hi.
  </para>
</usx>
